{
 "format": "damap",
 "version": 1,
 "id": "99",
 "name": "Aesry Surlaenis'a",
 "file": "Map99_Aesry_Surlaenis'a.xml",
 "rooms": [
  {"id":1,"x":40,"y":170,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Pivo'hrr'schu'Mus","descriptions":["The northwestern corner of the city is curiously barren of both houses and trees, save for a single building set well away from the street.  A peculiar aroma from the building wafts over the crushed shell path, bringing the scent of curing animal hide.  The only entrance is a wooden gate leading to the tanning courtyard."],"exits":[{"to":2,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":66,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":17,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden gate"}]},
  {"id":2,"x":70,"y":170,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ilerthan'a","descriptions":["The soft breeze sends a few pieces of paper wafting into the air and brings with it an unidentifiable smell from the west.  A few trees are scattered along the landscape on this otherwise somewhat barren section of the road."],"exits":[{"to":3,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":3,"x":100,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ilerthan'a","descriptions":["A beautiful statue of a leaping dolphin breaking through cresting waves marks a small shrine dedicated to the Goddess Eluned.  Flowers and other offerings have been placed carefully at the base.  A small walkway leads to a flowerbed full of daisies."],"exits":[{"to":4,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":2,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":4,"x":100,"y":110,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ilerthan'a","descriptions":["Small cracks in the stepping stones have formed from years of exposure to the elements.  Fewer trees line this section of roadway, allowing a view of nearby rooftops and the clouds which surround the inner lake."],"exits":[{"to":5,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":3,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":5,"x":130,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ilerthan'a","descriptions":["The pungent scent of drying herbs lingers in the air as it emanates from a small shop.  The sea-foam green walls of the building are painted with gilded riolur leaves and jadice flowers, and a wreath of blocil berries entwined in ivy hangs above the door.  A small group of wounded exit the building with their remedies in hand."],"exits":[{"to":6,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":4,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":21,"exit":"go","move":"go small shop"}]},
  {"id":6,"x":160,"y":50,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ilerthan'a","descriptions":["Stately homes are topped with white tiled roofs and nestled between towering oaks and lush flower beds.  Children dart between houses, shrieking with laughter and dismay while playing games of hide and seek.  A stone bench sits back from the street, beneath the sheltering gaze of a willow tree, awaiting weary travelers who wish to stop and rest their feet.","Light from several lanterns dances off the thin walls of the nearby homes.  The shadow of a woman can be seen moving about one of the homes as she settles in for the night.  A stone bench sits back from the street, in the deep shadows of a willow tree, awaiting weary travelers who wish to stop and rest their feet."],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":5,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":7,"x":190,"y":50,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ilerthan'a","descriptions":["Two well dressed Elven women walk arm in arm off to the side of the path, the crushed shells of the street crunching with each step.  They stop occasionally to laugh and smell the fragrant flowers, interspersed among a myriad of hedgerows and lilac bushes.  A dapper looking gentleman tips his hat toward the ladies which causes them to break into a fit of giggles.","The sound of chirping crickets breaks the silence of the night.  Occasional footsteps can be heard in the darkness as a traveler's foot makes contact with the crushed shells of the street."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":6,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":8,"x":220,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ilerthan'a","descriptions":["A soft breeze rustles through the trees, bringing with it a scent of freshly cut grass.  The few homes that are located in this section of town have well-manicured lawns that are a deep shade of green.","The sound of silence is broken by a soft breeze that rustles through the trees.  The call of a she-wolf to her mate echoes in the dark, bringing with it a feeling of unease. "],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":7,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go stone building"}]},
  {"id":9,"x":250,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ilerthan'a","descriptions":["A few homes can be seen scattered through the trees, their white-tiled roofs showing in contrast to the darkness of the leaves.  A squirrel sits on its hind legs while holding an acorn in its paws, occasionally glancing at one of the passersby."],"exits":[{"to":10,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":8,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":22,"exit":"go","move":"go courtyard gate"}]},
  {"id":10,"x":280,"y":50,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ilerthan'a","descriptions":["The street wends its way throughout the picturesque neighborhood.  A small songbird perches on the limb of an ancient oak tree, singing to all who pass by.  The sprawling green lawns and white-tiled roof of the historic Ilerthan home peeks out from behind an elegant wrought-iron gate to the east.","Small lanterns mark the entrances to some of the courtyards throughout the neighborhood.  The stillness of night is broken occasionally by the sound of a distant bell emanating from one of the boats on the lake."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":9,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":11,"x":310,"y":50,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ilerthan'a","descriptions":["A wrought-iron gate surrounds the grounds of the beautiful historic Ilerthan house.  Beyond the gates water trickles into a carved stone fountain in the central courtyard.  Green orchids and birds of paradise are in abundance throughout the grounds adding a distinct elegance to the surrounding atmosphere."],"exits":[{"to":12,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":10,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":23,"exit":"go","move":"go wrought-iron gate"}]},
  {"id":12,"x":340,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ilerthan'a","descriptions":["A light breeze dances across your skin, rustling the leaves and carrying with it a refreshing scent of the inner lake.  The sound of children giggling and playing fills the air and seems to be emanating from one of the courtyards of the nearby homes.","The stillness of the night is broken by the sound of a hooting owl or an occasional bark by a family guard dog.  The leaves of the trees are disturbed by a light breeze that brings with it a refreshing scent."],"exits":[{"to":13,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":11,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":13,"x":370,"y":110,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ilerthan'a","descriptions":["The ground is covered with a profusion of green orchids that have spread throughout the area and overtaken much of the free ground space.  A small overhang provides a resting area where one can stop and enjoy the overwhelming scent of the flowers.  A few benches are provided so one can sit and rest their tired feet."],"exits":[{"to":14,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":12,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":14,"x":370,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ilerthan'a","descriptions":["Plush topiary hedges trimmed into the shape of leaping dolphins line the street, allowing glimpses of the courtyards to some of the nearby homes.  The papered walls are painted with golden dolphins and other symbols and most of the homes have high glossed white tile roofs that add to the beauty of the area."],"exits":[{"to":13,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":15,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":15,"x":400,"y":170,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ilerthan'a","descriptions":["Rows of white stepping stones carved into the shape of leaping dolphins are pressed into the ground and surrounded by a mixture of green and white crushed shells.  The papered walls of the houses in this side of town are sea-foam green in color and compliment the greenish hue of the street."],"exits":[{"to":16,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":14,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":35,"exit":"go","move":"go courtyard gate"}]},
  {"id":16,"x":430,"y":170,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Lanahh'Mus","descriptions":["Columns of dark black stone support the tile roofs of the nearby houses.  Paper lanterns dangle above the street, each one painted with scenes of the sea.  The gated courtyards of the nearby houses are filled with the happy shrieks of children at play.","Columns of dark black stone blend into the shadows beneath the tile roofs of the nearby houses.  Lit paper lanterns fill the street with light, each one painted with scenes of the sea.  Merry music rises from the courtyards of the nearby houses as bards and actors entertain the local families."],"exits":[{"to":37,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":15,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":17,"x":40,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Tanner's Courtyard","descriptions":["The pungent smell of curing pelts fills the air, coming from several large vats along one wall of the courtyard.  A paper-screen door leads into the furrier's shop.  To the southeast, a crushed shell pathway lies beyond the yard's wooden gate."],"exits":[{"to":18,"exit":"go","move":"go paper-screen door"},{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden gate"}]},
  {"id":18,"x":40,"y":130,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Egani's Furs","descriptions":["Dira'ela Egani sits behind a counter piled high with assorted pelts and body parts of the animals which roam the island.  Busy sorting and cataloging the furs, she always has time to speak with an adventurer about purchasing a new hide.  An open screen behind her leads to the leather repair shop run by her husband."],"exits":[{"to":20,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":19,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":17,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Furrier","Tanner"]},
  {"id":19,"x":30,"y":130,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Tanning Supplies","descriptions":["Several small tables support an array of bottles, jars, patterns and leather working tools.  A delicate counter of darkly polished teak runs across most of the room, behind which sits an aging clerk.  Long shelves line the walls behind the counter, stacked with assorted material."],"exits":[{"to":18,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Tanning Supplies"]},
  {"id":20,"x":50,"y":130,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Sefu's Leather Repair","descriptions":["Racks of leather armor in various stages of repair fill the room.  Sefu himself sits at a long wooden workbench, laboring over a piece of armor for a customer.  Many of his tools, though still sturdy, are worn from years of use."],"exits":[{"to":18,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Sefu's Leather Repair","Repair Leather"]},
  {"id":21,"x":100,"y":50,"z":0,"title":"Taernen's Alchemical and Herbal Supplies","descriptions":["Glass bottles sit in haphazard rows on dark shelves along the back wall of the shop.  In the far corner, an iron cauldron bubbles over a bronze brazier set into the brick floor.  Bundles of herbs hang from hooks on the rafters."],"exits":[{"to":5,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Taernen's Alchemical and Herbal Supplies","Herbalist","Alchemist","Alchemy Supplies"]},
  {"id":22,"x":250,"y":50,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Rinko","descriptions":["Interlocking green and ivory-hued stones form a tranquil patio around a small meditation pool filled with water lilies.  At each corner of the courtyard is a curved willow branch bench flanked by large pots of flowering thyme, the pink and purple blossoms cascading onto the stones.  The bells and ribbons of the otoh'em chime, hung over the gatepost, flutter softly at each arrival."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":23,"x":310,"y":10,"z":0,"title":"Ger Ilerthan, Courtyard","descriptions":["An elegantly raked gravel walkway meanders toward the house, diverting around a burbling marble fountain on its way.  Delicate paper lanterns stand ready for the coming of night, protected from the elements by cunning metal caps.  A narrow garden surrounds the fountain, containing lovingly tended orchids and birds of paradise.  The east and west wings of the house shelter the courtyard from the winds.","An elegantly raked gravel walkway meanders toward the house, diverting around a burbling marble fountain on its way.  Delicate paper lanterns cast a soft illumination, protected from the elements by cunning metal caps.  A narrow garden surrounds the fountain, containing lovingly tended orchids and birds of paradise.  The east and west wings of the house shelter the courtyard from the winds."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":11,"exit":"go","move":"go wrought-iron gate"}]},
  {"id":24,"x":310,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Ger Ilerthan, Courtyard","descriptions":["Bordered by delicate paper lanterns, the walkway ends at the foot of a large teak door bound in iron.  A plush garden carpets the ground before the front walls of the house.  Startlingly lush and exotic blooms appear here and there throughout the garden as the dense growth sways in the gentle courtyard breezes.","Bordered by delicate glowing paper lanterns, the walkway ends at the foot of a large teak door bound in iron.  A plush garden carpets the ground before the front walls of the house.  Startlingly lush and exotic blooms appear here and there throughout the garden as the dense growth sways in the gentle courtyard breezes."],"exits":[{"to":23,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":25,"exit":"go","move":"go teak door"}]},
  {"id":25,"x":310,"y":-10,"z":0,"title":"Ger Ilerthan, Foyer","descriptions":["Polished cedar flooring reflects back the faint glow of the oil lamps that light the area.  Walls of thin, bone-white rice paper stretch between sturdy wooden supports, while intricate Elothean knot patterns decorate the high ceiling between the trusses.  The east wing is dedicated to worship and study, while the west wing leads to the private chambers of those who help to maintain this household."],"exits":[{"to":30,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":26,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":24,"exit":"go","move":"go teak door"}]},
  {"id":26,"x":300,"y":-10,"z":0,"title":"Ger Ilerthan, Hallway","descriptions":["A stream of water endlessly trickles down a seemingly random pile of polished rocks placed in the center of the room, falling into a low pool filled with tiny blue and yellow striped fish.  Light streams through broad windows forming the southern wall, highlighting gleams of copper in the polished cedar floor planks.","A stream of water endlessly trickles down a seemingly random pile of polished rocks placed in the center of the room, falling into a low pool filled with tiny blue and yellow striped fish.  Warm light streams from the oil lamps on the walls, highlighting gleams of copper in the polished cedar floor planks."],"exits":[{"to":25,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":27,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":27,"x":290,"y":-10,"z":0,"title":"Ger Ilerthan, West Wing","descriptions":["Set into the west wall is a large window made up of small panes of frosted glass held in place by a wrought-iron framework.  The color of the glass shades from purest white to the blue of the sky over the ocean on a cloudless spring day.  The daylight streaming through it creates the illusion that the room is suspended somewhere in the heavens, illuminating the master artistry of the subtle pattern and the interplay of the colors.","Set into the west wall is a large window made up of small panes of frosted glass held in place by a wrought-iron framework.  The color of the glass shades from purest white to the blue of the sky over the ocean on a cloudless spring day.  The warm light of the oil lamps illuminates the master artistry of the subtle pattern and the interplay of the panes of color."],"exits":[{"to":26,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":28,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":28,"x":290,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Ger Ilerthan, West Wing","descriptions":["A row of doors is set into the western wall, and opposite them across a stretch of polished cedar floor is a low black-lacquered table.  Placed to one side on the table is a translucent carved jade vase, holding a tumble of fresh geshiloira flowers accented by a single upright twig."],"exits":[{"to":27,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":29,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":29,"x":290,"y":10,"z":0,"title":"Ger Ilerthan, West Wing","descriptions":["Thick, translucent paper, sheltered from the elements by the overhanging roof outside, forms the eastern wall.  At the end of the hallway, an anlas candle burns steadily, wafting the faint smell of incense into the air."],"exits":[{"to":28,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":30,"x":320,"y":-10,"z":0,"title":"Ger Ilerthan, Hallway","descriptions":["Small oil lamps line the delicate rice paper walls, their warm glow casting soft shadows throughout the hallway that leads deeper into this once grand mansion turned monastery.  A large archway provides access to the chapel area, a place for quiet meditation and worship by the inhabitants and caretakers.  A bamboo runner softens the floor, continuing eastward toward the offices and library."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":25,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":31,"x":330,"y":-10,"z":0,"title":"Ger Ilerthan, East Wing","descriptions":["Large ebony-framed windows admit the daylight to reflect from the rice paper walls, warming the area and chasing darkness from even the deepest of corners.  Outside, the courtyard garden blooms in an exuberant display of artistically-arranged color, and the faint scent of the blossoms drifts through the hall.","Large ebony-framed windows form a sheet of blackness, reflecting the gleam of the glowing delicate oil lamps spaced evenly along the hallway.  From the dark garden outside, the faint scent of night-blooming flowers drifts through the area."],"exits":[{"to":32,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":30,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":32,"x":330,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Ger Ilerthan, East Wing","descriptions":["Paintings adorn the walls at intervals, set against a simple backdrop of rice paper panels.  Though some of the artwork has faded over time, most show recent restoration work.  Beneath them, a low planter holds a miniature tree sweeping its branches toward the ground in an elegant arch."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":33,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":33,"x":330,"y":10,"z":0,"title":"Ger Ilerthan, East Wing","descriptions":["A large window unobstructed by hangings allows a sweeping view of the courtyard garden through leaded glass panes.  Now unlit, small oil lamps stand ready for the coming of night.  An open sliding door leads into the library, a haven for scholars in search of knowledge.","A large window of small leaded glass panes unobstructed by hangings reflects the images of the small oil lamps lighting the passage in a warm, flickering glow.  An open sliding door leads into the library, a haven for scholars in search of knowledge."],"exits":[{"to":32,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":34,"exit":"go","move":"go sliding door"}]},
  {"id":34,"x":340,"y":10,"z":0,"title":"Ger Ilerthan, Isinrel","descriptions":["Scores of books fill the plain shelves lining the walls of the room, many written by Ilerthan herself.  A low table, surrounded by scholars of all races, rests in the center of the room.  A priest of Lemicus dusts the books and shelves."],"exits":[{"to":33,"exit":"go","move":"go sliding door"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Wisdom"]},
  {"id":35,"x":400,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Courtyard","descriptions":["A home in the ondjai style faces a courtyard paved with the same greenish shells of the road.  In the center, white stepping stones surround a young bay tree.  A small sign emerges from a grassy perimeter to identify the home as open to the public during business hours."],"exits":[{"to":15,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":36,"exit":"go","move":"go ondjai"}]},
  {"id":36,"x":400,"y":130,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Building Supplies for the Honorable Ondjai","descriptions":["Samples of the beautifully shaped tiles and panels and screens that make up the basic construction of the ondjai or mountain home are displayed on low tables.  The shop owner speaks in low tones in answer to questions, but smiles in delight at each purchase."],"exits":[{"to":35,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":37,"x":430,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Lanahh'Mus","descriptions":["Crushed white and light rose shells mingle together to form a pathway stretching northward from a flight of basalt steps.  Wooden birds of all types survey the area from their perch on the branches of an ancient aganylosh'a."],"exits":[{"to":16,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":38,"exit":"climb","move":"climb basalt steps"}]},
  {"id":38,"x":430,"y":230,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Lanahh'Mus","descriptions":["Bushes of Eluned's tears line the crushed shell street, their gentle blue and white blossoms filling the air with delicate perfume.  The screens of the nearby houses are painted with images of crashing waves.  A flight of basalt steps leads to the highest terrace of the city."],"exits":[{"to":39,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":37,"exit":"climb","move":"climb basalt steps"}]},
  {"id":39,"x":430,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Lanahh'Mus","descriptions":["Sapphire blue tile decorates the almhara columns of Surlaenis's magic shop.  The thick paper screens that form the building's walls are decorated with arcane sigils from the lore of all eleven races.  A sign above the door reads, Ferishan, Naesara Enthar'a."],"exits":[{"to":38,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":40,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":41,"exit":"go","move":"go magic shop"}]},
  {"id":40,"x":430,"y":290,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Lanahh'Mus","descriptions":["The crushed shell pathway curves to the west, leading to the Ayor Eloir'i'a.  Several homes cluster around a white marble fountain with a stone dragon in the center.  Cheerful shrieks echo up the street from the south.","The crushed shell pathway curves to the west, leading to the Ayor Eloir'i'a.  Several homes cluster around a white marble fountain with a stone dragon in the center.  The sound of adult laughter echoes from the street to the south."],"exits":[{"to":39,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":173,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":42,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":41,"x":400,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Zenastara's Magical Curios","descriptions":["Plump seating cushions and plain low tables are scattered around the room.  Bronze lamps overhead provide bright illumination for scholars interested in browsing through the merchandise.  Zenastara, the proprietress of the shop, bustles about straightening and dusting, pausing to answer the occasional inquiry."],"exits":[{"to":39,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Zenastara's Magical Curios","Magic","cambrinth"]},
  {"id":42,"x":400,"y":290,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Ayor Eloir'i'a","descriptions":["A glimpse of the lake is seen through the slender white birch trees that line the street.  Yellow and white crushed shells are firmly pressed into the ground, giving the street an almost golden hue.","A soft glow comes from the oil lanterns that are spaced far enough apart to allow passersby to make their way in the darkness.  Every so often a faint splash of water is heard coming from the lake in the otherwise still night."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":43,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":43,"x":370,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Ayor Eloir'i'a","descriptions":["A sign hangs over the door of a quaint yet elegant looking shop.  The back door is propped open to allow the fresh air to filter inside.  A trail of sand and shells leads from the street to the shop, kicked about by the steady stream of customers as they go about their business of the day.","Shadows dance off the trees as the lanterns cast light upon them.  The back door of the local gem shop is visible in the dark.  An occasional hooting of an owl breaks the stillness of the night."],"exits":[{"to":46,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":42,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":44,"exit":"go","move":"go back door"},{"to":45,"exit":"go","move":"go elegant shop"}]},
  {"id":44,"x":340,"y":270,"z":0,"title":"Shoiya's Gems, Purchasing","descriptions":["A curtain of multi-colored beads hangs in front of a closed screen that divides the purchasing room from Shoiya's shop.  Sitting behind a counter of dark rosewood, an elderly Elothean woman polishes a jeweler's loupe hanging from her neck.  Several boxes on the counter hold various gems nestled in black velvet cloth."],"exits":[{"to":43,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":45,"exit":"go","move":"go closed screen"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Gems"]},
  {"id":45,"x":340,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Shoiya's Gems","descriptions":["Windchimes of delicate crystal hang from the ceiling of this elegant jewelry shop.  Intricate Elothean shesegri are painted in blue, red and green upon the paper walls.  Shoiya stands behind an ebonwood counter topped by mottled marble, running her business with a serene smile."],"exits":[{"to":43,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":44,"exit":"go","move":"go bead curtain"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Shoiya's Gems","Jewelry Shop"]},
  {"id":46,"x":370,"y":230,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Ayor Eloir'i'a","descriptions":["The road curves off to the northwest, allowing an exquisite view of the lake.  A statue carved from rose-colored coral sits upon a small balcony where people are gathered to enjoy the breathtaking scenery below.","Shadows from the lantern bounce off the albatross statue giving it a warm pinkish glow.  Lights flicker below and the stillness of the night is occasionally broken by the sound of splashing water."],"exits":[{"to":43,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":47,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":47,"x":340,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Ayor Eloir'i'a","descriptions":["The street continues to wind around the lake.  Birch trees grow abundantly here, their green leaves blocking the view of the world beyond.  A well-tended bed of blooming melilots line the side of the road, the yellow flowers complimenting the golden hue of the shells that make up the road.","The birch trees look menacing in the pitch blackness of the night.  Nothing lights the way as the road curves around the lake.  An occasional crunching sound is heard underfoot as a loose shell is stomped back into place by people hurrying along in the darkness."],"exits":[{"to":46,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":48,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":61,"exit":"go","move":"go stone building"}]},
  {"id":48,"x":310,"y":170,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Ayor Eloir'i'a","descriptions":["A few benches sit beneath a sprawling willow tree that looks out of place in contrast to the birch trees that are dominant along this part of the island.  Some children play tag in the grass and around the tree, while others feed pieces of bread to a flock of wrens that hungrily peck at the crumbs with their beaks.","The leaves rustle as a group of nadira birds settle into their nest for the remainder of the night.  The eerie sound of a howling wolf off in the distance breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":47,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":49,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":49,"x":280,"y":170,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Ayor Eloir'i'a","descriptions":["The road narrows as it curves to the southeast, passing through a scattered cluster of birch trees.  A small building stands in the clearing, its papered walls painted with golden symbols of the Immortals.  Chalices and other clerical items are displayed proudly in the window.  Robed priests exit the shop, their purchases in hand as they walk silently away.","A lantern flickers in the window of a nearby shop, lighting the path for customers.  A stray tom cat skulks near the entrance hunched and ready to pounce on an unsuspecting mouse that scurries towards the side of the shop."],"exits":[{"to":48,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":50,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":62,"exit":"go","move":"go shop"}]},
  {"id":50,"x":250,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Ayor Eloir'i'a","descriptions":["A man in a straw hat tends to a small row of hedges expertly trimmed into several exquisite topiary animals.  A group of passersby stop to appreciate the beautiful work.  A single wren sits upon the tip of the nose of a leaping dolphin, its head cocked to one side, ready to leap into flight should anyone get too close.","A rustling comes from nearby as everything settles down for the night.  A faint splash is heard, as well as an occasional ringing of a boat bell off in the distance.  ","A rustling comes from nearby as everything settles down for the night.  A faint splash is heard, as well as an occasional ringing of a boat bell off in the distance."],"exits":[{"to":49,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":51,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":51,"x":220,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Ayor Eloir'i'a","descriptions":["A small shrine surrounded by a large bed of flowers stands off to one side.  A trail of the same shells that form the road branches off and leads up towards it.  Worshippers have placed offerings of everything from bird feathers and flowers to a beautiful carved ivory albatross at the foot of the small statue.","Lanterns are spaced evenly along the alcove to the shrine.  Candles surround the statue, giving the inside a warm soft glow.  The smell of flowers lingers in the night air and off in the distance the sound of an unknown animal howls to its mate."],"exits":[{"to":50,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":52,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":453,"exit":"go","move":"go simple building"}]},
  {"id":52,"x":190,"y":170,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Ayor Eloir'i'a","descriptions":["An elegant shop stands off to the side, its thick papered walls painted with golden books and scrolls.  A row of columns made from marbled granite line the front of the building.  Each column is carved into the shape of an elegant fae holding an open book in its hands as if intently reading it.  A few robed scholars exit the shop with purchases in hand.","The light flickers from the lanterns casting a shadow on the door of the shop.  The silence of the night is occasionally broken by the sound of the bell over the door ringing as a late night scholar enters the shop to make a purchase."],"exits":[{"to":51,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":53,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":63,"exit":"go","move":"go scribe's shop"}]},
  {"id":53,"x":160,"y":170,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Ayor Eloir'i'a","descriptions":["Shaped stones are placed on the pathway leading up towards a small carved statue of a jackal that marks the front of an entrance to an elegantly peaceful looking building.  Women wearing shrouds over their face enter the building with flowers in hand, a solemn look on their faces.","Lanterns placed on either side of the door give the entrance an eerie glow as the shadows bounce off the inner walls.  A statue is barely visible in the dark and the smell of flowers is very strong."],"exits":[{"to":52,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":54,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":64,"exit":"go","move":"go peaceful building"}]},
  {"id":54,"x":130,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Ayor Eloir'i'a","descriptions":["Large quantities of rolled fabrics and other materials can be seen through the window of a quaint shop on the corner.  Mannequins are adorned with fine hand-made clothing and are placed carefully in the front window for passersby to admire.","The columns of the building can barely be seen in the darkness.  The shop is quiet but still open as the flickering of candles can be seen from within.  A few stray buyers exit the shop in a hurried manner as if not wanting to be out and about in the dark of the night."],"exits":[{"to":53,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":55,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":67,"exit":"go","move":"go fashionable shop"}]},
  {"id":55,"x":100,"y":230,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Ayor Eloir'i'a","descriptions":["A carved fountain made of rose colored coral stands in the middle of a small square.  Benches are placed around the fountain and under some trees to provide a resting place for weary travelers.  A couple of elderly Elven men sit on one of the benches having an animated conversation.","The benches stand empty and the only sound is the trickling of the water coming from the fountain.  A flicker of light reflects in the water as the soft glow from the lanterns illuminates the square."],"exits":[{"to":54,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":56,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":56,"x":100,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Ayor Eloir'i'a","descriptions":["Tall hedges conceal the nearby homes allowing only a view of their tiled roofs.  Walking along the street, an occasional glimpse of the thick papered walls can be seen through a small opening.","The tall hedges loom in the darkness, casting weird shadows on the road ahead.  Flickerings of light can be seen through open spots in the hedges emanating from the lanterns in the front yards of many of the homes.  An occasional twittering from a bird is heard as it settles in for the long night ahead."],"exits":[{"to":55,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":57,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":57,"x":70,"y":290,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Ayor Eloir'i'a","descriptions":["Crushed red shells mix with the golden ones as the road heads towards the west.  The hedges thin out here and allow a full view of the homes that line the street.  Many of them have well tended gardens and a few have fountains in the central courtyard, adding a touch of elegance to the homes."],"exits":[{"to":56,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":58,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":58,"x":40,"y":290,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Pivo'hrr'schu'Mus","descriptions":["The red and white crushed shells of the street curve around a disc of black metal set into the ground.  Columns of dark stone support the black tile roofs of the nearby houses, their thick paper walls decorated with images of various animals."],"exits":[{"to":59,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":57,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":70,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":59,"x":40,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Pivo'hrr'schu'Mus","descriptions":["The rasping sound of steel meeting steel rises from a low building on the western side of the crushed shell path.  A sign hangs above the ornate gate which stands between the street and the building's courtyard."],"exits":[{"to":60,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":58,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":68,"exit":"go","move":"go steel gate"}]},
  {"id":60,"x":40,"y":230,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Pivo'hrr'schu'Mus","descriptions":["Water trickles down a flight of basalt stairs and into a deep pool beside the path.  A pair of statues stand beside the pool, their cool white forms a stark contrast to the darkness of the stairs.  The courtyards of the nearby homes gleam with a variety of flowers and herbs."],"exits":[{"to":59,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":66,"exit":"climb","move":"climb basalt stairs"}]},
  {"id":61,"x":370,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Origami Boutique","descriptions":["Scented candles scattered throughout the room welcome visitors with a steady glow and spicy aroma.  A cream-colored rug covers most of the flagstone floor, while tapestries hang loosely over the walls, gently absorbing the candlelight.  A narrow mahogany counter set against the back wall is joined in each corner by long shelves set into the side walls."],"exits":[{"to":47,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Origami Boutique"]},
  {"id":62,"x":280,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Mother Marilla's Clerical Supplies","descriptions":["Sunshine streams through an open window, filling the room with light.  A crystal bowl filled with dried rosepetals sits on the windowsill, the warmth of the sunlight releasing the intense sweet fragrance of the flowers.  In the middle of the room, a young Halfling lass perches atop a stool behind the counter as she studies a scroll.  A catalog near her elbow lies open to display its table of contents.","Moonlight filters through the window's shutters, lending a soft glow to the white paper walls.  A crystal bowl filled with dried rosepetals sits on the windowsill, perfuming the cool night air with a faint sweet fragrance.  In the middle of the room, a young Halfling lass rubs her eyes as she perches atop a stool behind the counter, studying a scroll.  A catalog near her elbow lies open to display its table of contents."],"exits":[{"to":49,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Mother Marilla's Clerical Supplies","Clerical Shop"]},
  {"id":63,"x":190,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Nakuge's Scriptorium","descriptions":["Skylights in the roof fill the white-papered walls of the shop with light, providing illumination for the scribe, Nakuge, as he labors at his desk.  Parchments lie in disorderly stacks upon the shelves at the back of the shop, mingling with books and boxes in an untidy jumble.  An owl perches atop the back of a chair, drowsy in the daytime but still quick to wake at the sound of a mouse in amongst the papers.","Skylights in the roof flood the shop with moonlight, while brass-trimmed oil lamps provide illumination for the scribe, Nakuge, as he labors at his desk.  Parchments lie in disorderly stacks upon the shelves at the back of the shop, mingling with books and boxes in an untidy jumble.  An amber-eyed barn owl perches atop the back of a chair, alertly eyeing the shop in the moonlight."],"exits":[{"to":52,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Nakuge's Scriptorium","Scriptorium"]},
  {"id":64,"x":160,"y":159,"z":0,"title":"Morgue","descriptions":["This small room has a bare, wood-plank floor and simple pine chairs pushed against the walls.  Each footfall or noise disturbs the quiet with a sharp echo.  Otherwise a deathly stillness rules, where even a whisper is an explosion of sound."],"exits":[{"to":65,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":53,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Morgue"]},
  {"id":65,"x":160,"y":149,"z":0,"title":"Morgue, Casket Room","descriptions":["A cold black altar, carved with swelling waves and the bowed figures of mourners, faces the entrance to the room.  The remains of a wilted bouquet rest on a prayer rug spread before the altar.  Several caskets are stored along one wall, ranging from simple to elaborate styles."],"exits":[{"to":64,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#400040","aliases":["Depart"]},
  {"id":66,"x":40,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Pivo'hrr'schu'Mus","descriptions":["Bursts of melody arise from a stone and coral fountain.  Water trickles over the font's edge and runs down a flight of dark basalt stairs.  A deep groove runs the length of the stairs, marking the years of the water's passage."],"exits":[{"to":1,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":60,"exit":"climb","move":"climb basalt stairs"}]},
  {"id":67,"x":130,"y":170,"z":0,"title":"Miakoda's Fine Clothing","descriptions":["A curious wrought iron sculpture hung with silver bells and glowing incense sticks stands beside the entrance of the shop.  The bells chime sweetly as patrons brush against them, and the intense sweet scent of jasmine perfumes the air.  Rosewood cabinets arranged against the pale peach-tinted walls provide storage for fabrics, while mannequins at the center of the room display some of the clothing offered for sale."],"exits":[{"to":54,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Miakoda's Fine Clothing","Clothing Shop"]},
  {"id":68,"x":70,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Isendry's Weapons Training, Harti","descriptions":["Thick paper walls surround the courtyard, painted with images of crashing waves.  Dark blue flowers grow opposite the steel gate leading back to the street.  The delicate chiming of steel upon steel echoes through a paper screen door in the western wall."],"exits":[{"to":69,"exit":"go","move":"go screen door"},{"to":59,"exit":"go","move":"go steel gate"}]},
  {"id":69,"x":70,"y":250,"z":0,"title":"Isendry's Weapons Training, Entrance","descriptions":["Bright light streams through the paper screen door leading to the courtyard.  Through a white birch archway, figures engage each other in a dance of blades, their weapons flashing in the light.  A large sign hangs upon the northern wall."],"exits":[{"to":68,"exit":"go","move":"go screen door"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Reflex"]},
  {"id":70,"x":40,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Pivo'hrr'schu'Mus","descriptions":["The mist-draped waters of the lake surrounding Eluned's temple glisten in the light.  Standing at the top of a long flight of basalt steps, a statue of an Elven child looks down at the terrace below, his tiny hand stretched out in yearning."],"exits":[{"to":58,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":71,"exit":"climb","move":"climb basalt steps"}]},
  {"id":71,"x":40,"y":350,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Pivo'hrr'schu'Mus","descriptions":["Kneeling before a flight of dark basalt steps is a statue of an Elven woman with her face pressed into her hands.  On the ground before her chiseled knees lies a garland of Eluned's tears."],"exits":[{"to":72,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":70,"exit":"climb","move":"climb basalt steps"}]},
  {"id":72,"x":40,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Pivo'hrr'schu'Mus","descriptions":["Several houses, shaped like oversized horseshoes with a wooden gate across the opening, face the crushed shell street.  Each family has placed a small statue or fountain in the center of their private garden.  The gates are often left open to allow wandering performers to entertain the household."],"exits":[{"to":71,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":73,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":73,"x":40,"y":410,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Pivo'hrr'schu'Mus","descriptions":["Graceful aganylosh'a surround the walkway of crushed red and white shells, their long branches providing shade and filling the air with the scent of fresh sap.  To the east, the imposing white quartz columns of the Library of Lemicus rise above the surrounding buildings."],"exits":[{"to":72,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":74,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":91,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":74,"x":70,"y":410,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["A magnificent building faces the water -- a monument to the arts, it houses the learning tools of the island and is known as Misrel Lemicus'a.  The white quartz columns are carved with symbolic images of the gods, of music and life, a multitude of spirals, concentric circles, rays and serpentine twists.  Gateless, the entrance arch to the building's courtyard welcomes the curious, the seeker, the lost, the hopeless.  A bed of kelpbells grows along the pathway and inside the courtyard beyond."],"exits":[{"to":75,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":92,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":73,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":164,"exit":"go","move":"go library arch"}]},
  {"id":75,"x":100,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["This section of the road sweeps in an arc around the northern side of the lough.  Crushed white shells, mixed with a few pale grey hermit shells, form the roadbed and provide a level surface for traveling even in muddy weather.  A breeze often gusts fingers of mist from over the water, but they quickly vanish once over land."],"exits":[{"to":76,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":74,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":76,"x":100,"y":350,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["A large, solid stone building stands on the western side of the road.  It is without windows, and a sturdy, locked gate blocks the courtyard entrance.  A hefty watchman stands outside at all times, his key the sole means to get in or out.  Opposite, splashes and bubbles dot the surface of the water where the mist clinging to the lake thins momentarily.","A large, solid stone building stands on the western side of the road.  It is without windows, and only a pale weak light seeps through a sturdy, locked gate which blocks the courtyard entrance.  The sound of soft lapping water comes from the direction of the lake, which is dark along this poorly lit section of road."],"exits":[{"to":77,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":75,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":160,"exit":"go","move":"go sturdy gate"}]},
  {"id":77,"x":130,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["The Third Stone of the Cloud is designated by three deep gouges at the top of a long upright standing stone.  It rises from the bedrock of the island, and no plants grow near it.  Its stark aloneless is most beautiful.  Looking from the stone over to the temple spire in the center of the lough aligns one on the exact northwest radius of the island, and a wooden pier extends along the same imaginary line into the lake.  Nearby, a damaged currach lies upturned on the gritty sand."],"exits":[{"to":78,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":76,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":159,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden pier"}]},
  {"id":78,"x":160,"y":290,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["The road widens before a pristine building consisting of white quartz columns and a grand overhanging roof abutting the rocky crags of the hillside.  The eaves shelter the bleached white wood and pale paper screen walls along the sides and front of the building.  Broad steps lead up to the gated entry, and a flag with the symbol of the Tribunal Government hangs above the gateway.  Plantings of heather and rare rock garden specimens landscape the front, right down to the water's edge."],"exits":[{"to":79,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":77,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":152,"exit":"go","move":"go government building"}]},
  {"id":79,"x":190,"y":290,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["The spectacular rock gardens of the government buildings extend here as far as the front of a small single-room structure to the east of the main offices.  An open gateway displays a sign, and several citizens stand on the steps and porch beneath the eaves, discussing some matter of great importance.","The spectacular rock gardens of the government buildings extend here as far as the front of a small single-room structure to the east of the main offices.  An open gateway displays a sign."],"exits":[{"to":80,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":78,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":149,"exit":"go","move":"go gateway"}]},
  {"id":80,"x":220,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["The rocky soil bordering the road is only suited to sustaining the heath and heather plants that cling with grasping roots.  The foliage is a mixture of different greens and creates a varigated carpet that sets off the pale shell roadway.  To the east, a ledge of basalt juts out and shades the road."],"exits":[{"to":81,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":79,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":145,"exit":"go","move":"go office"}]},
  {"id":81,"x":250,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["The pale shell roadway narrows to a path which winds between a jutting rock-ledge of the hillside and the soft black sand of the lough shore.  The overhanging ledge of dark basalt shades most of the path from the sun and weather."],"exits":[{"to":82,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":80,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":144,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ledge"}]},
  {"id":82,"x":280,"y":290,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["A deep gouge in the hillside creates the perfect location to place the arena.  The building's stone columns gleam a clean white and the broad steps of the approach are cut from the rock slopes in wide, smooth layers."],"exits":[{"to":83,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":81,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":83,"x":310,"y":290,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["The rocky slope forces the road away from the lough in an arc.  A white-columned building simply landscaped with low heather and prickly gorse stands out stark against the darker island rock.  Travelers hurrying in and out check their belongings, and the small sign nestled among the gorse points to an entrance."],"exits":[{"to":84,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":82,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":139,"exit":"go","move":"go white-columned building"}]},
  {"id":84,"x":340,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["The northern slopes of the island are drier and rockier than the forested and grassy areas to the east and south.  A rough tumble of steep rocky crags and heather-covered ground stretches above to the north.  The Fourth Stone of the Cloud stands impaled in the barren ground here, the four grooves that mark it gouged at the top.  This is the tallest of the four menhirs."],"exits":[{"to":85,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":83,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":85,"x":370,"y":350,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["The hillside rises upwards at a gentle slope to the east to form a grassy park area above the road, bordered beyond by the terrace of the second tier's street.  A line of birches further than the inhabited sections marks the abrupt steep slant up to heavily wooded upper reaches of the island."],"exits":[{"to":86,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":84,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":86,"x":370,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["The soft ground near the water's edge slants in a steady slope up to an undulating grassy hill.  A cluster of buildings dot the knoll, the largest house crowning the mound's top.  The sound of singing and low chanting comes from the Cloister and echos off the blanketing cloud of mist over the lake.  The singing fades softly and dissipates like the fingers of fog, even the crunching of the shells underfoot grows quieter and shushes before the home of the Ru'atin Peri'el."],"exits":[{"to":85,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":87,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":138,"exit":"go","move":"go grassy hill"}]},
  {"id":87,"x":400,"y":410,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["An intimate open-air theater is nestled between a grassy knoll to the north and the steep eastern slopes of the hillside.  A grove of birch trees surrounds the milky-white walls of the theater and shelters a path to a small wooden building that houses the theatre entrance.  A row of benches line the shore side of the road, a nice spot for gazing over the misty lake or waiting for the theatre to open its doors."],"exits":[{"to":88,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":107,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":86,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":130,"exit":"go","move":"go building"}]},
  {"id":88,"x":430,"y":410,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Lanahh'Mus","descriptions":["Rising above the street are the orached columns that support Surlaenis island's playhouse.  Each paper screen wall is painted with a scene from one of the many plays performed by the company.  A covered walkway leads west from the back of the building to the amphitheater."],"exits":[{"to":89,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":108,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":87,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":89,"x":430,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Lanahh'Mus","descriptions":["Music chimes through the air as the light glints off of the prayer gate dedicated to Faenella.  Part of the crushed shell pathway branches out to run beneath the gate, the pink and white shells blending into the shadows beneath the arch.  Many of the homes nearby the gate have musical instruments painted on their paper screen walls."],"exits":[{"to":90,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":88,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":136,"exit":"go","move":"go prayer gate"},{"to":392,"exit":"go","move":"go meeting portal"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Premium Portal","Portal"]},
  {"id":90,"x":430,"y":350,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Lanahh'Mus","descriptions":["An imposing flight of dark basalt stairs leads up to the next terrace.  Gleaming in the light, the cloud-draped waters of the lough to the west can be seen through the gaps between houses.  Small courtyards, each an oasis of color, lie in the center of each house, blocked by an iron gate.","An imposing flight of dark basalt stairs leads up to the next terrace.  An inky darkness, glimpsed between the houses, pinpoints the location of the lough to the west.  Small courtyards, each an oasis of color, lie in the center of each house, blocked by an iron gate."],"exits":[{"to":89,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":173,"exit":"climb","move":"climb basalt stair"},{"to":417,"exit":"go","move":"go courtyard"}]},
  {"id":91,"x":40,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Pivo'hrr'schu'Mus","descriptions":["Large, pale yellow trees flank the smooth mother-of-pearl prayer gate dedicated to Eluned.  The staho stretches to the north and south, leading to the higher tiers.  A thick white cloud rests upon the deep blue waters of the lake to the east, its ruffled surface broken only by a spire of gleaming white quartz which rises from the hidden island."],"exits":[{"to":73,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":92,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":93,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":389,"exit":"go","move":"go prayer gate"}]},
  {"id":92,"x":70,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["The bank building stands on a slight rise in the terrace terrain.  The entrance is through a jail-like gate which swings open during business hours.  Two tall cedars sway ceremoniously at the junction of the short path leading to the gate."],"exits":[{"to":74,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":95,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":91,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":111,"exit":"go","move":"go bank gate"}]},
  {"id":93,"x":40,"y":470,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Pivo'hrr'schu'Mus","descriptions":["The Inn of the Crystal Wave, an imposing building constructed in the unique Surlaenis style, stands on the eastern side of the street.  A statue carved from light yellow aganylosh'a wood stands in the middle of the path, surrounded by a low bench for travellers to rest on."],"exits":[{"to":91,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":94,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":393,"exit":"go","move":"go dirt path"},{"to":395,"exit":"go","move":"go inn"}]},
  {"id":94,"x":40,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Pivo'hrr'schu'Mus","descriptions":["The red and white crushed shells of the staho end at the base of a long flight of basalt steps which lead to the next terrace.  Several houses line the street, their dark stone columns holding up thick paper screens decorated with images of crashing waves."],"exits":[{"to":93,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":193,"exit":"climb","move":"climb basalt steps"}]},
  {"id":95,"x":100,"y":470,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["Thousands of small, shimmering pale grey and white crisp shells crunch underfoot as the road continues to circle the lough.  A finger of fog drifts off from the water in slow puffs before dissipating into thin smoky nothing."],"exits":[{"to":96,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":92,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":116,"exit":"go","move":"go market tent"}]},
  {"id":96,"x":100,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["A bordering hedge of cloudberry bushes lines the raked-shell road, and the plants' small white blossoms emit a fragrant perfume.  A cluster of birch trees shades the western side of the road, their thin branches fluttering with dancing leaves."],"exits":[{"to":95,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":97,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":97,"x":130,"y":530,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["The First Stone of the Cloud rises erect from the soft ground near the lough's edge.  The same shells that form the road surround the menhir, clear of all vegetation but a pruned whisper bush which spreads out at the base.  The first stone marks the southwest radius of the island and is designated so by a single groove gouged near the top."],"exits":[{"to":98,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":96,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":98,"x":160,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["A grassy slope on the lake side of the road leads down to a small pier that extends a short distance into the mist-shrouded lake.  Bits of white and grey shell tracked into the lawn catch the eye, white dots among the dark green blades."],"exits":[{"to":99,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":97,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":118,"exit":"go","move":"go pier"}]},
  {"id":99,"x":190,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["A small building that unassumingly mirrors the grandest of Aesry Surlaenis'a faces the mist of the lough.  A divided wooden gate with bronze fittings stands open at all times.  Both sections of the gate display medallions with the symbol of the empath guild and two small wreaths of healing herbs.","The light from the small building facing the lake spills onto the road and reflects off of the pale shells underfoot.  A torch at the gate brightens the bronze fittings and the medallions which clearly mark the building as the empath guild."],"exits":[{"to":100,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":98,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":119,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden gate"}]},
  {"id":100,"x":220,"y":590,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["Just a stone's throw from the empath's guild, the two story hospital stands shaded by three unusually large rowan trees.  The white quartz stone building gleams under the shading boughs and reflects the reddish bark and green leaves of the rowans.  A wrought-bronze gate depicts Hodierna's rearing unicorn in the tracings of its curves.","Just a stone's throw from the empath's guild, the two story hospital stands shaded by three unusually large rowan trees.  The interior lights glow softly through the paper screen walls, lighting the whole structure like a huge white lantern.  A wrought-bronze gate depicts Hodierna's rearing unicorn in the tracings of its curves."],"exits":[{"to":101,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":99,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":123,"exit":"go","move":"go wrought-bronze gate"}]},
  {"id":101,"x":250,"y":590,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["Cloudberry bushes border both sides of the road and grow in a tumult of vigor, promising a rich crop of sweet golden berries.  Short springy grass covers the slope leading down to the lake's edge and is perpetually sprinkled with dew from the mist that hugs Cha'walkas.  Footsteps in the grass leave dark impressions visible through the wafting silvery mist."],"exits":[{"to":102,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":100,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":102,"x":280,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["To the east, the road crosses a shallow gully in the hillside by means of a narrow footbridge that arches in a gentle curve over the lower ground.  A silvery vine with purple papery blooms twines up the anchoring posts."],"exits":[{"to":101,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":103,"exit":"go","move":"go footbridge"}]},
  {"id":103,"x":310,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["To the west, the road crosses a shallow gully in the hillside by means of a narrow footbridge that arches in a gentle curve over the lower ground.  A silvery vine with purple papery blooms twines up the anchoring posts."],"exits":[{"to":104,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":102,"exit":"go","move":"go footbridge"},{"to":126,"exit":"go","move":"go vine-covered building"}]},
  {"id":104,"x":340,"y":530,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["The Second Stone of the Cloud, set amongst the soft ground of tule beds, marks the southeast radius of Aesry Surlaenis'a.  The plants have been trimmed and thinned to reveal the Human-tall clear quartz marker."],"exits":[{"to":105,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":103,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":105,"x":370,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["The road curves with the contours of the lake, coming very close to the water's edge at this point.  Tall tules separate the shell-surfaced road from the mist and nesting grounds of killdeer.  The birds call out their mournful cry from the thick of the tassel-topped rushes."],"exits":[{"to":106,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":104,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":106,"x":370,"y":470,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["Fresh water tumbles down a water course from the melting snows far above at the rim of the island and collects in a black stone-lined pool.  The road curves around it towards the lake, the pale shells set against the clear water sloshing against the black basin.  Benches surround the pool and provide a pleasant resting spot for a drink of fresh cool water."],"exits":[{"to":107,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":105,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":107,"x":400,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["A pier extends a short distance over the surface of the lake before disappearing into the steamy cloud.  The octahedral spire of the temple at the center of the lough rises above the mist clinging to the water.","A pier extends a short distance over the surface of the lake before disappearing into the darkness over the lake.  In the distance, the lighted spire of the temple at the center of the lough shines like a thin needle of moonlight."],"exits":[{"to":87,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":108,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":106,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":129,"exit":"go","move":"go pier"}]},
  {"id":108,"x":430,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Lanahh'Mus","descriptions":["A statue of gilded marble stands in the center of the street.  The crushed white shells curve around the image, as do those walking down the street.  Each traveller glances at it for a brief moment before quickly jerking their eyes away."],"exits":[{"to":88,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":109,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":107,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":281,"exit":"go","move":"go footpath"}]},
  {"id":109,"x":430,"y":470,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Lanahh'Mus","descriptions":["Contrasting sharply with the crushed white shells of the pathway, the glossy black prayer gate dedicated to Peri'el rises to the east.  A faint breeze wafts in from the west, bringing the salty scent of the inner lake."],"exits":[{"to":108,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":110,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":279,"exit":"go","move":"go prayer gate"}]},
  {"id":110,"x":430,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Lanahh'Mus","descriptions":["Leading northward from the base of a flight of stone steps, the white and pink shell pathway curves around a large flowerbed.  Several stone columns rise around the flowers, supporting a canvas sheet which provides shade for the plants.  A white marble bench stands across the street from the blossoms.","Leading northward from the base of a flight of stone steps, the white and pink shell pathway curves around a large flowerbed.  Several stone columns, each painted with a sweet-smelling substance that repells insects, rise around the flowers.  A white marble bench stands across the street from the blossoms."],"exits":[{"to":109,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":174,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stone steps"}]},
  {"id":111,"x":100,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Tona Kertigen, Harti","descriptions":["Surrounded by a marble bench, a thick oak tree towers over the courtyard, its thick branches providing shade for the bank, and those within.  Opposite a wooden gate leading to the street, a paper screen door leads into the tona, or bank."],"exits":[{"to":112,"exit":"go","move":"go screen door"},{"to":92,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden gate"}]},
  {"id":112,"x":110,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Tona Kertigen, Entrance Hall","descriptions":["Tiles of gold and silver-flecked marble line the floor.  A gentle breeze swirls through the room, rustling papers stacked on ebonwood tables.  Carefully watching the bank's customers, a well-armed guard stands beside the paper screen door leading out to the courtyard."],"exits":[{"to":113,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":111,"exit":"go","move":"go screen door"}]},
  {"id":113,"x":110,"y":430,"z":0,"title":"Tona Kertigen, Deposit Window","descriptions":["Bright light shines through an opening in the thick paper walls of the building.  A young acolyte of Kertigen sits behind a tall wooden counter, carefully recording the deposits handed to her.  To the west, a moneychanger awaits those in need of his services."],"exits":[{"to":112,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":114,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Bank","Teller"]},
  {"id":114,"x":100,"y":430,"z":0,"title":"Tona Kertigen, Exchange","descriptions":["Sitting behind a dark ebonwood table, a bored-looking Dwarf awaits those in need of a moneychanger's services.  A large board, listing currency exchange rates, is propped on one end of the table."],"exits":[{"to":113,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":115,"exit":"go","move":"go iron vault"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Money-changer","Exchanger"]},
  {"id":115,"x":90,"y":430,"z":0,"title":"Tona Kertigen, Bank Vault","descriptions":["A heavy iron grill covers the entrance to the vault, and guards armed with crossbows stand sentry on either side.  Within the vault, coins are stored in locked cabinets.  A Dwarven Moon Mage sits behind an ironwood table, his ankles shackled to the floor to prevent him from leaving the vault.  Clerks pass bags of money and official-looking documents through a moongate he maintains to transfer money to and from other banks."],"exits":[{"to":114,"exit":"go","move":"go vault entrance"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Premium Exchange"]},
  {"id":116,"x":130,"y":470,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, The Traders' Market","descriptions":["Soft breezes from the lake drift through the open flap, freshening the air in the market tent.  Denizens of the island both young and old wander inside -- some browsing, some buying, and some looking for a Trader to sell wares for them.  Light filters through the sturdy striped canvas, bathing the area in pale golden light."],"exits":[{"to":117,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":95,"exit":"go","move":"go tent flap"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Traders' Market","Bazaar","Tent"]},
  {"id":117,"x":130,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, The Traders' Market","descriptions":["Soft breezes drift in from the north, freshening the air in the market tent.  Denizens of the island both young and old wander through -- some browsing, some buying, and some looking for a Trader to sell wares for them.  Light filters through the sturdy striped canvas, bathing the area in pale golden light."],"exits":[{"to":116,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":118,"x":240,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Pier, Southwest Shore of Cha'walkas","descriptions":["New planks replace those that deteriorated past safety, giving the pier a patched-up look.  The grass lawn that grows close to the shore runs right up to the first boards of the pier.  Salt-encrusted pilings support the structure, and gentle waves foam and splash below."],"exits":[{"to":98,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":122,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steps"}]},
  {"id":119,"x":190,"y":590,"z":0,"title":"Empath's Guild, Courtyard","descriptions":["The green courtyard is planted with low-growing herbs -- yarrow, thyme, and pennyroyal make a carpet of fragrant softness.  A carved urn filled with cool, clear water reflects the sunlight and any breeze sends ripples over the surface.  Several benches, some in the sun, and one shaded beneath a butterfly bush, invite one to rest and contemplate the peace here.","The green courtyard is planted with low-growing herbs -- yarrow, thyme, and pennyroyal make a carpet of fragrant softness.  A carved urn filled with cool, clear water reflects the light of the lanterns hung from the roof and any breeze sends ripples over the surface.  Several benches invite one to rest and contemplate the peace here."],"exits":[{"to":120,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":121,"exit":"go","move":"go sliding screen"},{"to":99,"exit":"go","move":"go wooded gate"}],"aliases":["RS Empath"]},
  {"id":120,"x":190,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"Empath's Guild, Welcome Room","descriptions":["Soft straw mats cover the floor and large pillows with flower patterns arranged in a welcoming cresent make this visiting area a nice place to relax.  The northern screen walls stand open to allow a view of the courtyard.  A crystal windchime tinkles softly whenever the wind stirs it, but the overhanging roof and construction of the building keeps any harsh weather from disturbing the visitor.  A low brazier burns to keep the chill from the air during the cool season."],"exits":[{"to":119,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":121,"x":180,"y":590,"z":0,"title":"Empath's Guild, Guildleader's Study","descriptions":["A large work table stands in the center of the room, scarred from years of use and bearing multiple pale rings where wet containers have apparently rested.  Translucent white paper walls allow ample light for working or reading.  Low tables surrounded by soft teal green pillows hold piles of notes, sketches, and charts.","A large work table stands in the center of the room, scarred from years of use and bearing multiple pale rings where wet containers have apparently rested.  Dozens of candles in circular brass candelabra provide ample light for working or reading, their glow reflected by the gleaming white paper walls.  Low tables surrounded by soft teal green pillows hold piles of notes, sketches, and charts."],"exits":[{"to":119,"exit":"go","move":"go sliding screen"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Empath","Guildleader Alris","Alris"]},
  {"id":122,"x":230,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Cha'walkas, Beside the Pier","descriptions":["At the shore beside the salt-encrusting pilings of the dock, several sailors cluster about a stained wooden sign, arguing over who has seen the worst storm.  A small two-man boat is tied to the pier, a set of oars inside."],"exits":[{"to":118,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steps"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Strength"]},
  {"id":123,"x":220,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Shoan Isenil'a","descriptions":["The courtyard is planted with low growing herbs that form a pleasing pattern of mounds set against small white pebbles.  The focal point of the garden is a small white statue of a unicorn, her head bowed and horn resting humbly upon the ground.  A bench rests in the shade of the overhanging roof, and despite the traffic in and out of the healers' quarters, it is a peaceful spot.","The courtyard is planted with low growing herbs that form a pleasing pattern of mounds set against small white pebbles.  The focal point of the garden is a small white statue of a unicorn, her head bowed and horn resting humbly upon the ground.  A bench rests beneath the shelter of the overhanging roof, and despite the traffic in and out of the healers' quarters, it is a peaceful spot, as the interior light filters softly through the paper screens."],"exits":[{"to":100,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":124,"exit":"go","move":"go open screen"}]},
  {"id":124,"x":230,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Shoan Isenil'a","descriptions":["Light blue and green cushions cover the floor, placed there for guests waiting with friends and family to see the empath.  White paper walls glow in the light from several lanterns hanging from the ceiling.  An archway of white birch is set in the northern wall, leading to the empath."],"exits":[{"to":123,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":125,"exit":"go","move":"go birch archway"}]},
  {"id":125,"x":240,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Shoan Isenil'a, Raeshisen","descriptions":["Plump cushions, and the patients lying on top of them, litter the floor.  A section of the paper screen wall has been removed to allow a breeze to enter.  Bloody bandages fill a basket in the corner of the room.  A young Elothean woman tends the patients lying on the floor."],"exits":[{"to":124,"exit":"go","move":"go birch archway"}],"color":"#00BF80","aliases":["Healer","Autopath"]},
  {"id":126,"x":310,"y":530,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Shh'yris's Forge","descriptions":["Large windows ring the room, allowing a breeze to enter and cool Shh'yris as he labors at his forge.  The building, unlike most on Surlaenis, is made entirely of stone.  A large rack upon one wall is filled with tools of the smith's art."],"exits":[{"to":128,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":103,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":127,"exit":"go","move":"go passage"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Repair Metal"]},
  {"id":127,"x":300,"y":530,"z":0,"title":"Shh'yris's Forge, Public Rentals","descriptions":["The small back room is barren of furnishings except for a large oak table set up against the stone wall.  Soft light filters down a short flight of stone steps leading out through the west wall.  Leading eastward, back to Shh'yris's workspace, is an arched passage."],"exits":[{"to":126,"exit":"go","move":"go passage"},{"to":428,"exit":"go","move":"go steps"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Forge"]},
  {"id":128,"x":310,"y":520,"z":0,"title":"Shh'yris's Forge, Bellows Room","descriptions":["Great piles of coal fill the corner of the room.  The forge fire burns with white-hot flames, fueled by the coal and the efforts of Shh'yris's apprentices who labor at the bellows.  Sweat pours from their bodies, only to sizzle as it strikes the hot stone floor."],"exits":[{"to":126,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Stamina"]},
  {"id":129,"x":280,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Eastshore Pier, Liva'an Cha'walkas","descriptions":["The pier extends from the shore into the lake.  Tendrils of cloudy mist swirl delicately and rise from between the slatted wooden boards underfoot.  The rough wood is weathered and salt-stained, but in good condition.  Some old ropes hang from pilings, remnants of boats once tied here."],"exits":[{"to":107,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":130,"x":360,"y":410,"z":0,"title":"Theater, Entrance Hall","descriptions":["The interior of the wooden building is simple, but clean and nicely arranged.  Cushioned benches line the walls, placed below a mural depicting various scenes from popular song and play.  Several worn, but dust-free carpets, cover the wide-planked floor leading to a double door that opens into the audience area beyond."],"exits":[{"to":87,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":131,"exit":"go","move":"go double door"},{"to":132,"exit":"go","move":"go passage"}]},
  {"id":131,"x":350,"y":400,"z":0,"title":"Theater, Audience","descriptions":["The audience area is open to the sky and fitted into the natural slope of the hillside.  Although the theatre is not large, it makes up for grandeur in its intimacy and friendly setting.  Birch trees whisper and sway beyond the walls, and beautifully carved benches with backs offer comfortable seating to enjoy splendid entertainment."],"exits":[{"to":130,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":132,"x":350,"y":410,"z":0,"title":"Theater, Stage Right Wing","descriptions":["The off-stage space to the north of the stage area accesses the passageway leading to the entrance hall and the dressing room door.  A large trunk for storing props, and miscellaneous scenery, rest against the north wall, within easy reach of performers waiting to enter the stage."],"exits":[{"to":133,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":135,"exit":"go","move":"go dressing door"},{"to":130,"exit":"go","move":"go passageway"}]},
  {"id":133,"x":350,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Theater, Stage","descriptions":["The platform stage is wide and deep and looks out upon the sloping hill.  Heavy wooden planks, worn smooth from years of adventures re-enacted, are polished with the tears, laughter, and work of taleweavers.  Although the audience sits beneath the sky to enjoy the offerings upon the scaffold, the stage is sheltered from the weather."],"exits":[{"to":132,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":134,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Stage"]},
  {"id":134,"x":350,"y":430,"z":0,"title":"Theater, Stage Left Wing","descriptions":["The off-stage space to the south of the stage area is small and cramped, but does have barely enough room for performers waiting to make their entrance.  Ropes and pulleys for operating various stage machinery are jammed against the southern wall, and a pile of lumber is stacked into the only available space beneath the ropes and weights."],"exits":[{"to":133,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":135,"exit":"go","move":"go dressing door"}]},
  {"id":135,"x":340,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Theater, Communal Dressing Room","descriptions":["Although all performers must share the space for changing costumes, it is neatly organized despite the packed shelves and racks for storage of make-up and costumes attached to the walls.  A long mirror runs along another wall, and several benches, as well as one old overstuffed chair, furnish the room for those awaiting the start of their performance."],"exits":[{"to":132,"exit":"go","move":"go right door"},{"to":134,"exit":"go","move":"go left door"}]},
  {"id":136,"x":460,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Beneath the Prayer Gate","descriptions":["Resonating at the slightest sound, the pale rose quartz gleams with a rainbow of reflected light.  Patiently lifesculpted by a generation of Elves, the walls of the prayer gate meet seamlessly above.  Dense veins of black crystal writhe just beneath the surface of the gate, twisted by the lifesculptor's art into images of musical instruments."],"exits":[{"to":137,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":89,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":137,"x":490,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Faenella Prayer Gate","descriptions":["Rugged forests of white birch and silverwood trees climb the slopes of the mountain to the east, finally petering out at the snow line.  Perched precariously atop a rose quartz prayer gate, an orached wren watches over those who pass beneath.  The gate, dedicated to Faenella, is guarded by two soldiers who carefully eye all those who enter the city."],"exits":[{"to":136,"exit":"go","move":"go prayer gate"}]},
  {"id":138,"x":400,"y":350,"z":0,"title":"Grassy Hill, House of Ru'atin Peri'el","descriptions":["A grassy lawn atop the knoll leads to a solid wooden gate and pale stone walls surrouding a large home.  Little is visible of the house itself, beyond the dark tile roof that slopes in a gentle curve.  The sounds of singing and chanting from within rise and die rhythmically, but there is always some sound of strange singing, even if it is a single voice alone."],"exits":[{"to":86,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":139,"x":310,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Carousel Square","descriptions":["A massive conical building rises from the cobbles at the square's center, its snowy alabaster surfaces gleaming brilliantly.  A sparkling mosaic of coral and turquoise set above an oval doorway reads THE CAROUSEL."],"exits":[{"to":83,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":140,"exit":"go","move":"go oval doorway"}]},
  {"id":140,"x":310,"y":330,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, The Carousel","descriptions":["Exotic tapestries of every possible description drape the wall ringing the Carousel's core.  A circular roof supports a vast framework of iron and timbers rising to the building's apex.  Countless gears, pulleys and weights within the structure form the strikingly complex and beautiful mechanism which drives the Carousel."],"exits":[{"to":139,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":141,"exit":"go","move":"go desk"},{"to":142,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Vault","Carousel"]},
  {"id":141,"x":300,"y":330,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Carousel Desk","descriptions":["A long wooden desk spans the width of the western wall.  Brass lanterns hang from the ceiling, and the floor behind the desk is covered in spotless red tile."],"exits":[{"to":140,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["vault rent","vault transfer","Lost and Found"]},
  {"id":142,"x":310,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Carousel Booth","descriptions":["A polished steel lever protrudes from the eastern wall of the small, ebony-panelled room, flanking a steel door to the north."],"exits":[{"to":140,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"},{"to":143,"exit":"go","move":"pull lever;go door"}]},
  {"id":143,"x":310,"y":350,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Carousel Chamber","descriptions":["A sturdy vault, set in the back wall, stands ready for your use.  The floor is covered by a soft thick carpet of deep red, and the walls are paneled in polished gold pine.  Looking at the back wall, you notice a tiny gap between it and the rest of the room."],"exits":[{"to":142,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":144,"x":235,"y":230,"z":0,"title":"Atop the Ledge","descriptions":["The dark basalt ledge looks southward over the lake, and gusts of wind brush dust and grit scuttering over the stone's surface.  A small clump of gorse clings to a crevice of soil and whispers and clicks as it scratches against the rock."],"exits":[{"to":80,"exit":"none","move":"jump road"}]},
  {"id":145,"x":220,"y":290,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Orders Office, Lobby","descriptions":["Bright rays of daylight flood through the beveled panes of a small oval window and light up this room, which acts as parlor to guests and as the lobby of the Aesry Regional Orders office.  Various documents on the smooth plaster wall overhang a pair of stools that stand on either side of the desk in the corner.  Narrow hallways run east and west of the wide staircase whose sweeping curve leads to the upper floors.","The flickering flames of myriad candles cast a golden reflection in the beveled panes of a small oval window.  The warm glow lights up the room that is both parlor to guests and the lobby of the Aesry Regional Orders office.  Framed documents on the smooth plaster wall overhang a pair of stools that stand on either side of the desk in the corner.  To the east and west run narrow hallways adjoining a wide staircase, its curve leading to the upper floors."],"exits":[{"to":147,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":146,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":80,"exit":"go","move":"go heavy door"}],"aliases":["Orders Office"]},
  {"id":146,"x":210,"y":290,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Orders Office, Recruitment Hall","descriptions":["Simplicity seems to be the decorating order of the day in this hallway.  The walls are soft grey-white and rather plain, bare of any decoration save a single painting hanging from a small, inscribed picture hook.  Notwithstanding the elementary decor, the dominant feature here is the set of ornate arches that each boasts a pair of heavy curtains and a small plaque indicating the Order within."],"exits":[{"to":145,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":148,"exit":"go","move":"go ebonwood archway"}]},
  {"id":147,"x":230,"y":290,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Orders Office, Recruitment Hall","descriptions":["Simplicity seems to be the decorating order of the day in this hallway.  The walls are soft grey-white and rather plain, bare of any decoration save a single mirror hanging from a small-inscribed picture hook.  Reflecting the world around, the etched circle only emphasizes the elementary decor.  Notwithstanding the artistry of the mirror, the dominant feature here is the set of ornate arches that each boasts a pair of heavy curtains and a small plaque indicating the Order within."],"exits":[{"to":145,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":148,"x":210,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Orders Office, Iron Circle Recruitment Room","descriptions":["Placed above the archway is a massive gold and black shield etched with the vivid image of a mighty dragon and loosely draped with a banner of scarlet silk.  Atop a nearby table rests an elaborately feathered quill.  Against the far wall, a heavy wooden stand supports a wooden box, fastened with a polished silver lock.  Above it, a brass plaque hangs shimmering softly in the available light."],"exits":[{"to":146,"exit":"go","move":"go ebonwood archway"}],"aliases":["Iron Circle Recruitment Room"]},
  {"id":149,"x":180,"y":278,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Debt Office","descriptions":["Several sections of the paper walls have been removed, creating windows to let the cool breeze enter.  Beyond the windows lie the multicolored rock gardens that surround the government buildings, as well as the crushed shell path ringing the lake.  A clerk sits behind a white birch counter, waiting for those who need to pay their debts to the Tribunal."],"exits":[{"to":150,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":79,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":153,"exit":"go","move":"go registration office"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Debt"]},
  {"id":150,"x":190,"y":278,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Home Permits Office","descriptions":["The office for obtaining permits and licenses is pleasantly lit by a large paper screen panel that filters in the exterior light.  A soft-spoken clerk sits behind a counter of carved pale wood, her head bent as she studies the records before her.  A row of large silk cushions stands along one side of a low table topped with a vase of fresh flowers.","The office for obtaining permits and licenses is pleasantly lit by a shell-shaped lantern that hangs from the rafters overhead.  A soft-spoken clerk sits behind a counter of carved pale wood, her head bent as she studies the records before her.  A row of large silk cushions stands along one side of a low table topped with a vase of fresh flowers."],"exits":[{"to":151,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":152,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":151,"x":190,"y":268,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Home Exchange Office","descriptions":["The straw mats that form the floor create a zig-zag pattern in pale colors of wheat and cream.  A clerk sits behind a high counter with papers stacked neatly in piles for review or filing.  A breeze from an open screen brushes across them, fluttering the corners of the paper softly."],"exits":[{"to":150,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Home Exchange Office"]},
  {"id":152,"x":170,"y":268,"z":0,"title":"Tribunal Building, Courtyard","descriptions":["Soaring white quartz columns line the courtyard, supporting the overhanging roof and creating a shaded two-story cloister.  Pale blue marble and white quartz tiles covering the floor have been interlocked in a subtle pattern that creates a sense of the open ocean, with a round raised garden in the center.  The sounds of the street filter in only faintly through the polished bronze bars of the front gate, and matching bronze stairways climb up to either side.","Soaring white quartz columns line the courtyard, supporting the overhanging roof and creating a two-story cloister lit by dozens of brass and glass lamps.  Pale blue marble and white quartz tiles covering the floor have been interlocked in a subtle pattern that creates a sense of the open ocean, with a round raised garden in the center.  The sounds of the street filter in only faintly through the polished bronze bars of the front gate, and matching bronze stairways climb up to either side."],"exits":[{"to":153,"exit":"go","move":"go citizenship office"},{"to":154,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"},{"to":78,"exit":"go","move":"go front gate"},{"to":150,"exit":"go","move":"go broad arch"},{"to":155,"exit":"climb","move":"climb eastern stairway"},{"to":158,"exit":"climb","move":"climb western stairway"}]},
  {"id":153,"x":170,"y":278,"z":0,"title":"Tribunal Building, Office of Citizenry","descriptions":["Silk cushions in colors of rose and foam-green line the pale screened walls of this office.  A long dark carved table stands in the middle of the room with a young clerk waiting there patiently for the next new citizen of Surlaenis.  Collages of seashells and sponges hang from the dark beamed ceiling and often chime with any sudden breeze."],"exits":[{"to":152,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Office of Citizenry","Citizenship"]},
  {"id":154,"x":160,"y":278,"z":0,"title":"Tribunal Building, Council Chamber","descriptions":["Built into the living rock of the slope up from the central lake, the council chamber's back wall is raw basalt.  Midway across it, a stream flows down the jagged rock, dancing off projections to fall quietly into a narrow pool at the base.  In front of the pool, twelve unadorned chairs are arranged at a long table.  The rest of the room is filled with simple polished wooden armchairs for spectators."],"exits":[{"to":152,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":155,"x":180,"y":268,"z":0,"title":"Tribunal Building, Eastern Cloister","descriptions":["White paper walls interspersed with occasional copperwood doors form the eastern wall.  Opposite them, a polished brass railing runs between the gleaming white quartz pillars spanning the full two-story height of the building."],"exits":[{"to":156,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":152,"exit":"climb","move":"climb bronze stairway"}]},
  {"id":156,"x":180,"y":258,"z":0,"title":"Tribunal Building, Northern Cloister","descriptions":["A small set of silvery wind chimes hangs from the eaves of the roof, creating a musical counterpoint to conversation at the slightest breath of wind.  Overhead, rubbed copperwood planks have been laid in swirling patterns that gleam even in the shady retreat of the cloister.","A small set of silvery wind chimes hangs from the eaves of the roof, creating a musical counterpoint to conversation at the slightest breath of wind.  Overhead, rubbed copperwood planks have been laid in swirling patterns that gleam warmly in the light cast from the lanterns spaced at regular intervals."],"exits":[{"to":155,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":157,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":157,"x":160,"y":258,"z":0,"title":"Tribunal Building, Northern Cloister","descriptions":["The wide balcony stretches the width of the courtyard's northern edge, with the overhanging roof creating a sheltered and shady retreat.  Between the closed doors leading into the building are low planters, each holding a miniature tree, aged-looking, gnarled, and bent.","The wide balcony stretches the width of the courtyard's northern edge, with gleaming brass and glass lanterns creating a warm and glowing retreat.  Between the closed doors leading into the building are low planters, each holding a miniature tree, aged-looking, gnarled, and bent."],"exits":[{"to":156,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":158,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":158,"x":160,"y":268,"z":0,"title":"Tribunal Building, Western Cloister","descriptions":["The balcony runs to the north, with doors leading into various offices along the western side.  A polished brass railing runs between gleaming white quartz columns, providing security and a perfect view of the courtyard below.  From this angle, you can see that in the middle of the central garden is a tiny pool, surrounded by screening bushes that hide it from view at ground level."],"exits":[{"to":157,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":152,"exit":"climb","move":"climb bronze stairway"}]},
  {"id":159,"x":230,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Pier, Northwest Shore of Cha'walkas","descriptions":["The dark wood of the pier glistens with slick wetness.  Waves churn underneath as the lake sloshes against unseen rocks, and the cloudy mist drifts to hover low against the surface of the water.  The temple built upon a small rocky island in the center of the lake is visible above the lingering fog."],"exits":[{"to":77,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":160,"x":70,"y":350,"z":0,"title":"Jail, Courtyard","descriptions":["The courtyard is barren of ornament, and black gritty sand is raked in a stark pattern over the enclosed yard.  The roof of the building overhangs to provide a little shade, but on warm days, lingering here is most unpleasant in the burning sun.  A sturdy metal door at the far end of the courtyard is the only entrance into the windowless building."],"exits":[{"to":161,"exit":"go","move":"go door"},{"to":76,"exit":"go","move":"go gate"}]},
  {"id":161,"x":60,"y":350,"z":0,"title":"Jail, Guard Office","descriptions":["A single lamp burns brightly in the gloom of the tiny office, creating a claustrophobic feeling of eternal twilight.  A battered pine chair, a steel manacle dangling from one of its slats, sits next to a desk covered by stacks of dusty parchment.  Squeezed into a corner, a barrel has been set up as a makeshift table and holds the remains of the guards' last card game."],"exits":[{"to":162,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":160,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"aliases":["Jail","Guard Office"]},
  {"id":162,"x":60,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Jail, Corridor","descriptions":["Moisture, condensed from the humid air of the island, trickles down the walls of the hallway as if the cool stone were weeping.  An oversized door of black ironwood leads into the jail's single cell and bears the scars of those prisoners who were a bit reluctant to partake of its hospitality."],"exits":[{"to":161,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":163,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":163,"x":60,"y":370,"z":0,"title":"Jail, Justice Chambers","descriptions":["A narrow strip of blue and white tile leads to the base of a tall desk raised above the rest of the room by a platform.  Rows of backless benches provide seating, albeit uncomfortable, for onlookers interested in the proceedings and a large tapestry with the words Haron Par S'su embroidered on it in burnished gold thread hangs from the wall."],"exits":[{"to":162,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":164,"x":140,"y":410,"z":0,"title":"Misrel Lemicus'a, Courtyard","descriptions":["A sculpture fashioned from driftwood rests at the center of the bright courtyard.  Light reflects off the pale stone and paper screen walls, while the overhanging roof softens any glare.  Kelpbells grow throughout the space in curving flowerbeds that create a visual dance of shape and texture.  The slightest breeze bends the plants gracefully, further enlivening the rhythmic play for the eyes."],"exits":[{"to":165,"exit":"go","move":"go screen"},{"to":74,"exit":"go","move":"go gateless arch"}]},
  {"id":165,"x":150,"y":410,"z":0,"title":"Misrel Lemicus'a, Main Hall","descriptions":["The tiled floor of the main entry hall recalls a flowing stream of water rushing over a grid of stones.  A tall willow tree, planted in a massive wooden crate, spreads its limbs above, the tendrils of fluttering leaves drooping in graceful arcs.  Overhead, stone columns support a two-story rise to the ceiling above.  Several white quartz arches on the floor above, and to the north and south lead into study rooms of the library.  A carved wooden staircase to the west ascends to the second floor."],"exits":[{"to":166,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":167,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":164,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":168,"exit":"go","move":"go alcove"},{"to":169,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wooden staircase"}]},
  {"id":166,"x":150,"y":400,"z":0,"title":"Misrel Lemicus'a, Study Room","descriptions":["This section of the library is devoted to scientific studies, ranging from natural history to alchemy.  Beakers on the top of the book shelves demonstrate various chemical processes and dried, pressed specimens of plants and preserved insects are displayed beneath glass cases.  Chairs and a single large table are positioned near the paper screen walls to allow for good reading light.  A low bookcase circles the room and is filled with all manner of books upon such scientific subjects."],"exits":[{"to":165,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":167,"x":150,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Misrel Lemicus'a, Language Study Room","descriptions":["Comfortably cushioned chairs are grouped beneath overhead oil lamps.  Faded rugs soften footsteps and preserve the hushed atmosphere.  A bank of bookshelves on the east and one on the west divide the space into two smaller sections.  At the end of the room, a glass case houses an illuminated manuscript, carefully protecting it from any idle touch."],"exits":[{"to":165,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":168,"x":140,"y":400,"z":0,"title":"Misrel Lemicus'a, Shoan Sulihean","descriptions":["In a small alcove beneath the stairs, an Elothean scribe sits behind a large wooden table, staring at a piece of parchment and muttering to himself.  Puzzles of all types lie on the table, as well as several books of riddles.  A large sign hangs on the wall behind him."],"exits":[{"to":165,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Intelligence"]},
  {"id":169,"x":170,"y":430,"z":0,"title":"Misrel Lemicus'a, Upper Hall","descriptions":["The upper hall functions as a balcony and looks down on the main entrance below.  The splendid tile floor fashioned as a rushing stream of blues and pale green colors is best viewed from this angle.  White quartz archways lead into three additional study rooms, and lanterns shaped in fantastical shell shapes emit a softly glowing light.  Carpet runners soften footsteps along the pale wooden floor."],"exits":[{"to":170,"exit":"go","move":"go north arch"},{"to":171,"exit":"go","move":"go south arch"},{"to":172,"exit":"go","move":"go west arch"},{"to":165,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wooden staircase"}]},
  {"id":170,"x":170,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Misrel Lemicus'a, Spiritual Studies Room","descriptions":["This study room is a splendid pattern of dark and light, the wooden screen walls framed with ebonwood slats and pure white oiled-paper panels.  The floor is an inlaid design of dark and light woods in a spiraling formation, and the structure of the bookcases echoes the proportions of the screen walls.  Primitive stone carvings of the thirteen immortals rest in shell-shaped niches at regular intervals.  A table and chairs stand in the center of the room."],"exits":[{"to":169,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Spiritual Studies Room"]},
  {"id":171,"x":170,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Misrel Lemicus'a, Poetry and Music Room","descriptions":["Pale images of musical instruments -- a flute, a harp, a drum -- decorate the paper screen walls of the study.  Books of music and poetry are piled carelessly upon low bookshelves.  An old carpet covers the floor, the once bright colors stained with dark ink splotches.  Despite the jumble, the overstuffed chairs and water-stained round wooden table give the room a comfortable, inviting air, making it a quiet place for friends to gather, instead of just a sterile place of study."],"exits":[{"to":169,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Poetry and Music Room"]},
  {"id":172,"x":160,"y":430,"z":0,"title":"Misrel Lemicus'a, Magical Studies Room","descriptions":["Pale screen walls glow softly with the filtered light from outside, filling the room with a soothing light.  Rows of bookcases hold glass or crystalline shelves laden with books upon the subjects of magic.  Low tables, each with a glowing gaethzen sphere, are surrounded by worn cushions on which students may sit.","Pale screen walls glow softly with the filtered light from outside, filling the room with a soothing light.  Rows of bookcases hold glass or crystalline shelves laden with books upon the subjects of magic.  Low tables, each with a glowing gaethzen sphere, are surrounded by worn cushions on which students may sit.  A polished sandalwood telescope points toward an observation window set into the ceiling."],"exits":[{"to":169,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Magical Studies Room"]},
  {"id":173,"x":430,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Lanahh'Mus","descriptions":["Opposite a flight of basalt stairs, daily puppet shows for small children are performed in a wooden booth.  Surrounded by a ring of wooden benches, the booth is large enough for three grown Gor'Togs to stand inside comfortably.  A red curtain is drawn over the puppet's stage.","Opposite a flight of basalt stairs, nightly puppet shows for adults are performed in a wooden booth.  Surrounded by a ring of wooden benches, the booth is large enough for three grown Gor'Togs to stand inside comfortably.  A red curtain is drawn over the puppet's stage."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":90,"exit":"climb","move":"climb basalt stairs"}]},
  {"id":174,"x":430,"y":530,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Lanahh'Mus","descriptions":["The light glints from the white shells of the pathway, as well as from the silverwood sculpture which grows from the middle of the street.  Through the gaps between the houses, faint whisps of fog curl over the terrace below.  A flight of stone steps leads downward."],"exits":[{"to":175,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":110,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stone steps"}]},
  {"id":175,"x":430,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Lanahh'Mus","descriptions":["Bright ribbons fly from the thick paper screens of the art gallery.  Seven stone columns, each carved in the shape of a young man or woman of a different race, support the building's blue tile roof.  The Dwarf and Halfling columns show several members of each race standing on each other's shoulders until they are tall enough to reach the tile roof."],"exits":[{"to":174,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":176,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":178,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":176,"x":430,"y":590,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Lanahh'Mus","descriptions":["Bushes of silvery grey roses line the crushed shell pathway.  Small trails of the pink and white shells lead from the main street to the nearby houses.  White birch gates stretch across the openings of the horseshoe-shaped houses, granting some privacy to those within the courtyard."],"exits":[{"to":175,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":177,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":177,"x":430,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Lanahh'Mus","descriptions":["A pool of deep blue water lies at the base of a flight of basalt stairs.  So clear that the sky above is mirrored in its depths, the pool is surrounded by a firethorn bush to keep curious children from fouling its waters.  Set into the earth beside the hedge is a brass plaque."],"exits":[{"to":176,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":196,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":231,"exit":"climb","move":"climb basalt stairs"}]},
  {"id":178,"x":400,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ushiaena'a","descriptions":["Crushed shards of multi-hued seashells crunch underfoot with each step along the roadway.  A small shop stands on the northwest side of the street.  The sign hanging above the blue-striped awning bears the image of a raven, its outstretched wings forming the beams of a balance scale, evidently the local pawnshop."],"exits":[{"to":175,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":179,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":200,"exit":"go","move":"go small shop"}]},
  {"id":179,"x":370,"y":590,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ushiaena'a","descriptions":["Ceramic roof guardians loom along the edge of the tile roof on a nearby home.  The tiny figures guard the corners of the building, perched atop the black stone columns as they glare balefully at intruders.  One corner bears a graceful leaping dolphin, another, a phoenix rising amidst a realistic cloud of ceramic flames.  A courtyard stands in the center of the building, open to the street."],"exits":[{"to":178,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":180,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":180,"x":370,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ushiaena'a","descriptions":["A wrought iron gate accented with gilded dolphins guards the courtyard of a nearby home.  Beyond the gate, water burbles in a marble fountain with a statue of a mermaid playing a lyre.  As the breeze blows from the north, the chimes forming the lyre's strings play a soft melody.  The courtyard seems an oasis of peace when compared to the bustle of the street."],"exits":[{"to":179,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":181,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":201,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"}]},
  {"id":181,"x":340,"y":650,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ushiaena'a","descriptions":["Crushed seashells line the street and have been raked to form a pathway to a nearby shop.  The arrangement of the shells gradually changes from a random blend of multi-colored shards to individual strands of pale rose, coral, yellow, green, blue and violet, forming a delicate pastel rainbow."],"exits":[{"to":180,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":182,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":202,"exit":"go","move":"go shop"}]},
  {"id":182,"x":310,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ushiaena'a","descriptions":["Beside the road grows a tiny knot garden filled with all kinds of aromatic flowers, from love-lies-weeping to whispering wyndeflowers.  As travelers hurry by occupied with their concerns, local residents sit and chat on white stone benches, oblivious to the bustle of traffic which surrounds them.  At the center of the garden, the delicate branches of a graceful willow tree sway gently in the breeze."],"exits":[{"to":181,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":183,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":183,"x":280,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ushiaena'a","descriptions":["A lavender hedge grows beside the road, the pale blossoms filling the air with an intense, sweet fragrance.  To the north, a statue of an Elven woman holding a harp stands atop a fluted pedestal, the pale stone framed by the deep green leaves of a wyndewood tree.  Tiny stone wrens perch on the branches of the tree, some with beaks upraised as if in song, some with wings outstretched about to take off, even one depicted feeding tiny stone fledglings in a nest."],"exits":[{"to":182,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":184,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":184,"x":250,"y":710,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ushiaena'a","descriptions":["The road sweeps around in a shallow arc along the southern end of the crescent.  To the north, the mist rises over the lake at the center of the town, shrouding the temple and lending an odd, echoing quality to the temple bells as they ring the hours.  A shop stands along the southern side of the road, its heavy white paper walls contrasting vividly with the vibrant red tiles of its roof.  The faint scent of new leather wafts through the air."],"exits":[{"to":183,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":185,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":204,"exit":"go","move":"go cordwainer's shop"}]},
  {"id":185,"x":220,"y":710,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ushiaena'a","descriptions":["The road splits to curve around an ancient cedar tree.  Careful work pruning its gnarled branches, or perhaps a gentle touch of lifesculpting, has resulted in the faint image of a young woman in the bark of the tree.  Wrought iron chairs spread out in a semicircle facing the tree, as if a gracious hostess awaited guests for tea."],"exits":[{"to":184,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":186,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":205,"exit":"go","move":"go white shop"}]},
  {"id":186,"x":190,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ushiaena'a","descriptions":["Willow trees grow in graceful clusters about a freshwater pond in a nearby park.  The sounds of frogs and crickets combine in a monotonous chorus which echoes about the street.  A white gravel path wends its way among the trees toward the pond, the smooth stones gleaming gently in the moonlight."],"exits":[{"to":185,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":187,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":206,"exit":"go","move":"go gravel path"}]},
  {"id":187,"x":160,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ushiaena'a","descriptions":["Thin strips of metal inlaid in the roadbed outline the shape of a soaring albatross.  Crushed red coral fills the form, a vivid contrast to the pale multi-colored shells which form the rest of the street.  The design is repeated at regular intervals along the road, identifying the street name for travelers."],"exits":[{"to":186,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":188,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":188,"x":130,"y":650,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ushiaena'a","descriptions":["The air is sharp with the tang of heated metal wafting into the street from a low building nearby.  Unlike most buildings on the island, this one is composed of heavy slabs of creamy sandstone, and the rhythmic ring of hammer on metal echoes about the area.  The sign above the door bears the image of a silver-edged sword, identifying this as the local weapon shop."],"exits":[{"to":187,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":189,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":207,"exit":"go","move":"go sandstone shop"}]},
  {"id":189,"x":100,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ushiaena'a","descriptions":["A wooden shed nestles against the cool white sandstone walls of the local armory.  Bronze hardware accents the door, the knocker and doorknob adorned with an intricately engraved lion's head.  A narrow path of pale yellow crushed seashells leads up to the building, bordered by dark green holly bushes with bright red berries."],"exits":[{"to":190,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":188,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":208,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden shed"}]},
  {"id":190,"x":100,"y":590,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ushiaena'a","descriptions":["Smoke billows into the sky from a soot-streaked white sandstone chimney on a low building near the road.  The sign on the door identifies this as Martrem's Forge, the local armory.  A rhythmic pounding of hammer on metal, and an occasional curse accompanied by a dull thud of metal on flesh, reverberates through the open door."],"exits":[{"to":189,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":191,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":209,"exit":"go","move":"go forge"}]},
  {"id":191,"x":70,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Aeliy Ushiaena'a","descriptions":["A low copse of rowan trees grows in the courtyard of a nearby home.  The scalloped picket gate separates the courtyard from the street, though a clever arrangement of counterweights allow the gates to slide aside to permit visitors to enter.  White wrought iron benches surround the trees, sheltered by the leafy branches."],"exits":[{"to":190,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":192,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":210,"exit":"go","move":"go picket gate"}]},
  {"id":192,"x":40,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Pivo'hrr'schu'Mus","descriptions":["Standing amidst a grove of white birch trees is the island's general store.  A very plain building, its paper screen walls are decorated with images of pots and needles.  Many of the stone columns supporting its tile roof have been chiseled into shelves to hold samples of the proprietor's wares."],"exits":[{"to":193,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":191,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":194,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":211,"exit":"go","move":"go general store"}]},
  {"id":193,"x":40,"y":530,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Pivo'hrr'schu'Mus","descriptions":["Gleaming like a pearl on blue velvet in the light, the thick cloud surrounding Eluned's temple stretches out thin tendrils of mist onto the Liva'an Chawalkas.  A long flight of basalt steps leads down to the terrace surrounding the lake."],"exits":[{"to":192,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":94,"exit":"climb","move":"climb basalt steps"}]},
  {"id":194,"x":40,"y":590,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Pivo'hrr'schu'Mus","descriptions":["The street of crushed red and white shells winds between several houses along the road, each with its own gated courtyard.  A gleaming anloral hand, palm facing the sky, rises from the middle of the street.  Growing from the palm is a long silverleaf vine."],"exits":[{"to":192,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":195,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":195,"x":40,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Pivo'hrr'schu'Mus","descriptions":["An imposing flight of basalt stairs rises high above, leading to the next terrace.  Delicate music arises from the crystal and brass windchimes hung from a nearby house."],"exits":[{"to":194,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":212,"exit":"go","move":"go flower shop"},{"to":214,"exit":"climb","move":"climb basalt stairs"}],"aliases":["Sirese"]},
  {"id":196,"x":450,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Outside the Necropolis","descriptions":["The trail of crushed shells ends at an elegant white wrought-iron gate marking the entrance to the island's cemetery.  A bridge spanning a small pond of deep blue water, visible through the bars of the gate, lies not far beyond it."],"exits":[{"to":177,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":197,"exit":"go","move":"go white gate"}]},
  {"id":197,"x":450,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Gate","descriptions":["Water shimmers as the moonlight plays off the surface of a small pond just within the cemetery gates.  A wooden bridge with ornamental railings provides safe passage across the water.  The branches of the weeping willows bordering the pond sway gracefully in the current as the rhythmic chirps of crickets echo through the still night air.","Water sparkles as the sun plays off the surface of a small pond just within the cemetery gates.  A wooden bridge with ornamental railings provides safe passage across the water.  The branches of the weeping willows bordering the pond tremble gracefully beneath the weight of small birds that make their home here, while fish rise to the surface to nibble on the pale green leaves which trail along the water."],"exits":[{"to":198,"exit":"go","move":"go small bridge"},{"to":196,"exit":"go","move":"go white gate"}]},
  {"id":198,"x":450,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, On the Bridge","descriptions":["The bridge arcs high above the pond, providing an excellent view of the outer cemetery.  Below, the pond water is almost crystal clear, clear enough to view the fish swimming within.  A row of majestic oak trees line either side of the trail that leads deeper into the cemetery, while a bed of freshly planted daisies and daffodils line the path back to the gate."],"exits":[{"to":199,"exit":"go","move":"go trail"},{"to":197,"exit":"go","move":"go gate path"}],"aliases":["bridge"]},
  {"id":199,"x":450,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis","descriptions":["The trail ends at the base of a short stairway leading up to the main cemetery.  Massive granite gargoyles perch atop marble pedestals at the base of the stair, their lifeless eyes gazing impassively around the area.  Marigolds grow in clay pots on each step, providing a splash of color against the white marble stairs.  At the top of the stairs, a few headstones are barely visible on the hillside."],"exits":[{"to":198,"exit":"go","move":"go small bridge"},{"to":333,"exit":"climb","move":"climb short stair"}],"aliases":["Necropolis","Cemetery"]},
  {"id":200,"x":370,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Ishh's Used Goods","descriptions":["White birch shelves, piled high with used weapons and armor, line the walls.  Ishh stands behind a counter of mottled marble stone.  An obsidian plaque shaped like a flying raven hangs over the door leading out."],"exits":[{"to":178,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Ishh's Used Goods","Pawnshop"]},
  {"id":201,"x":340,"y":590,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, A Courtyard","descriptions":["The wrought iron gate separates the courtyard from the street, but allows an open view of the surrounding landscape.  The fountain in the center burbles a soothing tone in the night air as its water spills into the marble basin.  A single bench rests beneath the overhanging roof of the home."],"exits":[{"to":180,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":202,"x":310,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Joirin's Puzzles","descriptions":["Colorful baskets painted in every shade of the rainbow hang from the rafters, holding wood and other supplies for the puzzle maker.  The wicker and rattan containers provide a sharp contrast to the stark white paper walls of the shop itself.  A gilt-edged black leather catalog rests atop a fringed red silk shawl which has been draped over the counter."],"exits":[{"to":181,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":203,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Puzzles"]},
  {"id":203,"x":320,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Joirin's Puzzle Shop, Back Room","descriptions":["Several halfling children, each seated at a small table, labor industriously to build the puzzles their father sells in his shop.  An older woman walks among the children, helping them with the more difficult parts.  A large sign hangs on the wall opposite the wooden door leading out."],"exits":[{"to":202,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Agility"]},
  {"id":204,"x":250,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Bayanzi Gherkrish and Sons, Cordwainers","descriptions":["Shadows fill the corners of the dimly lit workshop.  The walls, once a pale shade of cream, are speckled with various colors from the leatherworker's dyes, while the relatively dust-free state of the floor seems due more to the presence of several cats wandering about than any use of a broom.  Piles of leather and oddly-shaped wooden forms are stacked on shelves along the back wall, while near the window the cordwainer sits on a stool, hunched over his current project."],"exits":[{"to":184,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Bayanzi Gherkrish and Sons","Cordwainers","Footwear"]},
  {"id":205,"x":220,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Field of Shields","descriptions":["Shields of all shapes and sizes line the walls.  Some are nicked and scarred from years of use -- trophies of war.  Others are bright and clean -- trophies of art.  The cool night air drifts in through the windows, carrying with it the gentle sounds of water from the distant lake.  An alert Elven clerk smiles politely as he directs entering customers toward the various displays.","Shields of all shapes and sizes line the walls.  Some are nicked and scarred from years of use -- trophies of war.  Others are bright and clean -- trophies of art.  Daylight streams through the wide open windows, brightly illuminating the shop.  A sleepy S'Kra Mur clerk smiles politely as he directs entering customers toward the various displays."],"exits":[{"to":185,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Field of Shields","Shields","Shield Shop"]},
  {"id":206,"x":190,"y":710,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Willow Park","descriptions":["The sound of crickets and frogs engaging in their nightly chorus echoes across the still waters of the pond.  A narrow white gravel path is bathed by the moonlight, like a pearl necklace surrounding the velvety dark waters.  The children who enliven the park by day have long since found their beds, leaving the night to young lovers who sit on wrought iron benches, exchanging kisses as they talk."],"exits":[{"to":186,"exit":"go","move":"go gravel path"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Discipline"]},
  {"id":207,"x":160,"y":650,"z":0,"title":"Kilora's Weaponry","descriptions":["Streaks of soot mar the cream-colored sandstone walls of the weaponsmith's workshop.  In the center of the room, a complex arrangement of wood and leather is connected to a set of beehive forges arranged in a cluster.  Beside each forge, a journeyman works at an anvil, crafting blades beneath the watchful eye of Master Smith Kilora Azmuthar."],"exits":[{"to":188,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Kilora's Weaponry","Weapon Shop"]},
  {"id":208,"x":130,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Brightwings' Engravings","descriptions":["A menu board listing the available patterns hangs from the shelf of a workbench which divides the front of the shed from the living area.  Behind it, flames flicker in a white sandstone fireplace.  A litter of puppies clusters around their mother on the hearthrug, their soft mewling cries barely audible above the crackle of burning wood."],"exits":[{"to":189,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Brightwings' Engravings","Engravings"]},
  {"id":209,"x":130,"y":590,"z":0,"title":"Martrem's Forge and Armory","descriptions":["The air is filled with the raucous din of apprentices' hammers striking the anvils about the forge.  Near the fire, a soot-streaked urchin labors over the leather bellows to fan the flames.  Supervising the confusion is a burly Gor'Tog smith who paces tirelessly about the room."],"exits":[{"to":190,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Martrem's Forge and Armory","Armory","Armor Shop"]},
  {"id":210,"x":100,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, A Courtyard","descriptions":["Young, graceful rowan trees shelter the benches that encircle the copse at the center of the courtyard.  A few fallen leaves flutter over the damp soil, awaiting a gardener's rake.  The sweet scent of rich earth and fragrant trees greets each breath, and the lull of breeze-blown branches softens the sounds beyond the picket gate."],"exits":[{"to":191,"exit":"go","move":"go picket gate"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":211,"x":70,"y":530,"z":0,"title":"Elver Rummeltum's Home and Garden Supplies","descriptions":["Baskets and plants fill the shelves of the general store, with even more sitting on a workbench off to one side.  The aroma of roasting meats and fresh-baked bread wafts through the open doorway of the catering shop, mingling with the fragrance of flowers grown by the pudgy Halfling shopkeeper who stands behind the counter."],"exits":[{"to":192,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":426,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Elver Rummeltum's Home and Garden Supplies","General Store"]},
  {"id":212,"x":70,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Erianthe's Flowers","descriptions":["Stoneware pots and wicker baskets scattered throughout the shop hold fresh flowers, their delicate petals filling the room with a heady fragrance.  Glass vials stacked on the window sill are used to extract the essential oils from herbs and flowers to make perfume.  A sun-bleached workbench near the window holds an open catalog, as well as an assortment of wire and thread, and a half-completed etrana blossom wreath."],"exits":[{"to":195,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":213,"exit":"go","move":"go spring room"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Erianthe's Flowers","Florist","Flower Shop"]},
  {"id":213,"x":70,"y":610,"z":0,"title":"Erianthe's Flowers, Spring Room","descriptions":["The grey stone floor vibrates slightly underfoot, and the sound of running water burbles through a metal grate in the far corner.  Quite a bit cooler than the rest of the shop, the walls of the spring room are lined with grey stone shelves on which elaborate flower arrangements are displayed in stoneware vases."],"exits":[{"to":212,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":214,"x":40,"y":650,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Pivo'hrr'schu'Mus","descriptions":["The northern crescents of the city are visible from this vantage point several hundred feet above the lake.  Ending abruptly at a flight of basalt stairs, a pathway of crushed red and white shells curves around an ancient oak tree."],"exits":[{"to":215,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":195,"exit":"climb","move":"climb basalt stairs"}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":215,"x":40,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Pivo'hrr'schu'Mus","descriptions":["Curving around a circle of stones, the path of crushed shells leads east to the southern crescent of the city.  Within the circle, a patient artist has created a portrait of colored sands."],"exits":[{"to":214,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":216,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":216,"x":70,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Chui'mysanda Jama","descriptions":["Iridescent flecks of sparkling quartz crystals mingle with crushed ivory seashells which pave the southern crescent of the town.  A low hedge of fragrant k'dira bushes lines the street, the faint aroma of its leaves identifying the plant, even in the darkness."],"exits":[{"to":217,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":215,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":232,"exit":"climb","move":"climb path"}]},
  {"id":217,"x":100,"y":710,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Chui'mysanda Jama","descriptions":["A horn plays the quick, stacatto notes of a march, the melody floating through the air from a nearby shop.  The heavy paper walls of the shop are painted with a faint white-on-white pattern of songbirds, complementing the carved leaves which embellish the black stone pillars.  A brass sign is inlaid on the pillar beside the entrance."],"exits":[{"to":218,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":216,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":258,"exit":"go","move":"go shop"}]},
  {"id":218,"x":100,"y":740,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Chui'mysanda Jama","descriptions":["The open courtyards of nearby homes provide their owners a splendid view of the town overlooking the mist-shrouded lake at the center.  Each courtyard is a peaceful oasis of tranquility amidst the bustle of daily life."],"exits":[{"to":217,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":219,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":257,"exit":"go","move":"go courtyard gate"}]},
  {"id":219,"x":130,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Chui'mysanda Jama","descriptions":["Hundreds of sparkling crystal prisms hang from the branches of cherry trees which grow in neat, if closely spaced, rows beside the road.  Each crystal chimes softly as it brushes against each other, creating a complex mix of light, aroma and music which changes with each breath of wind."],"exits":[{"to":220,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":218,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":220,"x":160,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Chui'mysanda Jama","descriptions":["Light streams from the windows which border nearby courtyards, illuminating the topiary which is scattered throughout the grass.  From the road, you can see a boxwood mermaid seated amidst lifesculpted birch tree waves."],"exits":[{"to":221,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":219,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":221,"x":190,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Chui'mysanda Jama","descriptions":["Young men and women clad in silken tunics and colorful leggings gather at tables arrayed on the wrought iron balconies which overlook the flower-filled courtyard in a nearby school.  The sound of adolescent laughter floats though the air as they work together to practice their lines for an upcoming play."],"exits":[{"to":222,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":220,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":256,"exit":"go","move":"go courtyard"}]},
  {"id":222,"x":220,"y":830,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Chui'mysanda Jama","descriptions":["Water sparkles in the light from a nearby home as it tumbles into the tiered crystal basins of a fountain.  Surmounting the structure is a statue of a young Elven woman with long hair and a patient expression listening to a youngster playing a golden flute.  Crystal phoenixes rise from each basin, filling the night with music as the water splashes against their upstretched wings."],"exits":[{"to":223,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":221,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":223,"x":250,"y":830,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Chui'mysanda Jama","descriptions":["Golden blossoms grow in clusters on lyrandia vines which twine their deep green tendrils along the rails of a whitewashed wooden fence which stands beside the road.  The skillful hand of the gardener who tends them keeps the flowers in bloom year round, filling the air with a subtle sweet aroma."],"exits":[{"to":224,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":222,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":255,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden gate"}]},
  {"id":224,"x":280,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Chui'mysanda Jama","descriptions":["Local residents gather on balconies facing their courtyards to enjoy jasmine tea and the company of friends.  Brightly colored ceramic roof guardians sculpted to depict various beasts, both real and imaginary, look out from the edges of the tiled roofs, keeping a watchful eye on all who pass."],"exits":[{"to":225,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":223,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":254,"exit":"go","move":"go courtyard gate"}]},
  {"id":225,"x":310,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Chui'mysanda Jama","descriptions":["A vibrant red-enameled wrought iron fence embellished with fanciful images of gilded harps and sleeping black dragons borders the road.  Crystals dangle between the risers of the fence, sparkling in the light and filling the air with music when brushed by the gentle touch of the wind."],"exits":[{"to":226,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":224,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":253,"exit":"go","move":"go courtyard gate"}]},
  {"id":226,"x":340,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Chui'mysanda Jama","descriptions":["An iridescent mix of quartz and crushed seashells crunches underfoot as travelers make their way past the homes which line the quiet street.  Elaborately carved black stone pillars support heavy white paper screens painted with faint scenes of merfolk at play."],"exits":[{"to":227,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":225,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":252,"exit":"go","move":"go courtyard gate"}]},
  {"id":227,"x":370,"y":740,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Chui'mysanda Jama","descriptions":["Crimson blossoms dangle from the branches of a sharktooth tree, like drops of blood dripping from the pale grey bark.  The tree stands within the courtyard of a nearby home, surrounded by low shrubbery lifesculpted into fanciful fish shapes.  Maiden's Tress vines dangle from the branches of other trees in the courtyard, swaying in the wind like seaweed caught in an underwater current."],"exits":[{"to":228,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":226,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":251,"exit":"go","move":"go courtyard"}]},
  {"id":228,"x":370,"y":710,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Chui'mysanda Jama","descriptions":["Seashells crunch beneath sandaled feet as residents make their way along the street.  Metal forms in the shape of musical notes inlaid along the edges of the roadbed hold crushed red coral.  Faint images of dolphins dart in and out amidst the notes."],"exits":[{"to":229,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":227,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":243,"exit":"climb","move":"climb path"}]},
  {"id":229,"x":400,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Chui'mysanda Jama","descriptions":["Crystal wind chimes dangle from tall poles and trees along the length of the street.  Their soft music mingles with the wind to identify the road to strangers and provide a comforting sense of home to local residents.  Sparkling flecks of quartz crystals are mixed with crushed shells to pave the crescent."],"exits":[{"to":230,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":228,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":230,"x":430,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Lanahh'Mus","descriptions":["The white and pink shells of the staho curve westward to join the chui'mysanda jama.  Many of the houses in this southeasternmost corner of the city are built within a grove of trees, rather than alongside the street.  A statue of an Elven woman stands beside the road, her head turned towards the trees."],"exits":[{"to":231,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":229,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":231,"x":430,"y":650,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Staho Lanahh'Mus","descriptions":["Shrouded by a cloak of mist, the Temple of Eluned rests on the island in the center of the lake.  Lush forests of white birch, silverwood, and willow can be seen through the gaps between the houses.  The crushed white and rose shells of the pathway continue running south from a flight of basalt stairs."],"exits":[{"to":230,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":177,"exit":"climb","move":"climb basalt stairs"}]},
  {"id":232,"x":40,"y":860,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Meadowlands","descriptions":["The path winds upwards towards the green meadows and farm fields, a low stone wall beside it piled with the stray rocks and boulders removed from the pastures.  Quilted crofts stretch upwards, nearly a third of the distance to the rim of Surlaenis, each a piece of patchwork over the southern slopes.  Downhill, the path merges into the trees and ondjai of the encircling streets of the city."],"exits":[{"to":233,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":216,"exit":"climb","move":"climb downhill path"}]},
  {"id":233,"x":70,"y":890,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Meadowlands","descriptions":["An unrepaired gap in the bordering walls reveals the spilling grass, blown in ripples by the wind.  Sheep graze across it, flecks of white and dark rising from the lushness.  The grass sprouts a goodly share of thistle and milkweed near one of the less cared for crofts."],"exits":[{"to":234,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":232,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":427,"exit":"go","move":"go beaten footpath"}]},
  {"id":234,"x":100,"y":890,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Meadowlands","descriptions":["The steeply slanted hillside undulates with rippling grass and uneven ground, neat stone walls parceling the cottages and crofts.  A bosky grove down the hill shelters a few dwellings clustered in the hollow.  A lit lantern or candle peeps through an unshuttered window like a star in the darkness.","The steeply slanted hillside undulates with rippling grass and uneven ground, neat stone walls parceling the cottages and crofts.  A bosky grove down the hill shelters a few dwellings clustered in the hollow.  In the distance the pale mist of Cha'walkas rises, and the faint outline of the temple steeple emerges in the gap of the trees."],"exits":[{"to":235,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":233,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":424,"exit":"go","move":"go grove"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":235,"x":130,"y":890,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Meadowlands","descriptions":["To the south, the meadow rises steeply, the grass clinging to rock-strewn soil in dark patches.  A winding path leads up to a solitary cottage.","To the south, the meadow rises steeply, the grass clinging to rock-strewn soil, and the sturdy sheep foraging for the lushest fodder.  A winding path leads up to a solitary cottage."],"exits":[{"to":236,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":234,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":241,"exit":"go","move":"go path"}]},
  {"id":236,"x":160,"y":890,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Meadowlands","descriptions":["Soft swells in the relatively flat terracing make excellent farmland here, overlooking the lough and encircling streets of the city down to the north.  The narrow path runs east and west, where several white-washed cottages aligned in a row face down the hill towards the center of the island."],"exits":[{"to":237,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":235,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":237,"x":190,"y":890,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Meadowlands","descriptions":["For a great distance there is nothing but meadowland, terraced fields dotted with wildflowers within the grass.  No animals graze here, only the wind sweeping across, brushing the unmown verdure into a flutter of rippling waves."],"exits":[{"to":238,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":236,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":238,"x":220,"y":860,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Meadowlands","descriptions":["The stone walls bordering the path are stained a saffron yellow from the lichen that grows upon the stone.  A field mouse nest, wedged against the bottom of the wall, is uninhabited at the moment."],"exits":[{"to":239,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":237,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":239,"x":250,"y":860,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Meadowlands","descriptions":["A wooden bridge crosses a stream pouring down the slope from the melting snows high at the rim.  The water races through the boulders and gathers speed as it plummets down the slope.  Little waterfalls drop the runnel over the edge before it swirls through the grass to drop again and again, tumbling musically to the lake below."],"exits":[{"to":238,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":240,"exit":"go","move":"go bridge"}]},
  {"id":240,"x":280,"y":860,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Meadowlands","descriptions":["To the west, the path continues over a small wooden bridge that spans a stream of melted snow and runoff.  Further east, the path begins a slow, gentle curve to the north as it runs along the ridge of the terraced meadowland.  An occasional stone cottage or small tree breaks the rhythm of mounded stone walls and steep hillside."],"exits":[{"to":242,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":239,"exit":"go","move":"go bridge"},{"to":244,"exit":"go","move":"go uphill path"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":241,"x":130,"y":860,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Meadowlands","descriptions":["The dwelling of a small farmstead stands upon a flattened bump on the hillside, a flower pot with herbs at the door.  The ground behind the cottage is rocky and perilously steep, a dark face on the blackest nights.  The lights of the buildings encircling Cha'walkas lake are visible through a persistent evening fog, fluttering through the veil of trees and cloud below.","The dwelling of a small farmstead stands upon a flattened bump on the hillside, a flower pot with herbs at the door.  The ground behind the cottage is rocky and perilously steep, but the white flecks upon it are a few intrepid sheep that somehow manage to make their way to browse on the persistent grass.  A zig-zagging path climbs back to the road below."],"exits":[{"to":235,"exit":"go","move":"go path"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":242,"x":340,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Meadowlands","descriptions":["The hillside drops precariously to the north, with only the bordering stone wall preserving the traveler from a plummet to rocks and trees far below.  A willow tree arches over the path, some of its branches cracked and broken.  A flat stone leans against the tree."],"exits":[{"to":243,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":240,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":243,"x":400,"y":740,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Meadowlands","descriptions":["The lane climbs sharply upwards towards the next terrace, with green meadowlands rising above it.  The ground is studded with chunks of rock, and the walls bordering the path are made from the same fieldstone cleared from the pastures.  On clear days you can see the stark white rim of the island above to the south, and the rising mists of Lake Cha'walkas down to the northwest."],"exits":[{"to":242,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":228,"exit":"climb","move":"climb path"},{"to":259,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steep lane"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":244,"x":310,"y":860,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Meadowlands","descriptions":["At the end of the steep path is a fieldstone cottage and its adjoining stone barn, the doors to each painted a rusty red color.  Smoke curls from the chimney of the cot and the yard is littered with woodchips from chopped firewood or crafters' work."],"exits":[{"to":245,"exit":"go","move":"go barn door"},{"to":247,"exit":"go","move":"go small cottage"},{"to":240,"exit":"go","move":"go downhill path"}]},
  {"id":245,"x":340,"y":860,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Marscern's Cottages and Building Supplies","descriptions":["Samples of stone and roofing materials are displayed for the customer to choose a preference.  The earthen floor is packed hard, and a pleasant, homey smell of straw and baking bread wafts through the open doorway that leads to the resident's cottage."],"exits":[{"to":246,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":244,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":246,"x":350,"y":860,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Marscern's Cottage Interiors","descriptions":["More samples of stone lie stacked in rows along the straw-strewn earthen floor, and different paneling materials are displayed along one wall of the barn.  Rustling sounds of a bird nesting and stirring come from a high gabled window overhead.  Marscern's younger brother, Mercelt, sits nearby ready to assist customers with their questions."],"exits":[{"to":245,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Marscern's Cottage Interiors"]},
  {"id":247,"x":280,"y":890,"z":0,"title":"Treywood Cottage Crafters","descriptions":["White plaster walls make the cluttered entrance hall seem slightly less crowded, though no paint can disguise the piles of dry lumber stacked in bins along the back wall.  The sweet scent of sandalwood mingles with the spicy smell of cedar and the sharp tang of varnish and lacquer as the craftsmen who share this cottage ply their trade."],"exits":[{"to":248,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":250,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":249,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":244,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":248,"x":280,"y":880,"z":0,"title":"Chidwycke's Chairs","descriptions":["Chairs, stools, benches and armchairs are clustered in conversational groupings around low tables in the shop.  From lightweight wicker to carved sandalwood, the shop offers a variety of seats to suit every taste.  A sign on the wall encourages potential buyers to examine each chair carefully to appreciate the fine workmanship."],"exits":[{"to":247,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Chidwycke's Chairs","Chairs"]},
  {"id":249,"x":270,"y":890,"z":0,"title":"Hibernations","descriptions":["The walls of the shop are painted a pale ivory, stenciled with a waist-high border of ivy vines.  A deep blue floral carpet cushions the floor as customers peruse the selection of beds and daybeds offered by the shopkeeper at Hibernations.  A small sign advises potential buyers to examine each piece carefully before making their decision."],"exits":[{"to":247,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Hibernations","Beds"]},
  {"id":250,"x":290,"y":890,"z":0,"title":"Tyngle's Tables","descriptions":["Tables and desks are scattered around the shop, from heavy, dark oak refectory tables to light weight black lacquer parson's tables.  The walls have been painted a neutral shade of ivory, and a thick wool carpet in a vibrant floral design covers the floor.  A nearby sign advises customers to examine the workmanship of each piece before making their decision."],"exits":[{"to":247,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Tyngle's Tables","Tables"]},
  {"id":251,"x":330,"y":710,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, A Courtyard","descriptions":["An uncommon tree, known as the sharktooth tree, shelters the overhanging roofs of the homes facing the courtyard.  Unusual specimens are prominent here, as lifesculpted shrubbery borders the walls of one ondjai, and maiden's tress vines dangle from two small trees that guard the entry to another.  Radiating paths connect the homes at the center -- an oval shell-paved contemplation area features a small shrub, just beginning its lifesculpted transformation to the shape of a leaping fish."],"exits":[{"to":227,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":252,"x":310,"y":740,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, A Courtyard","descriptions":["A cherry tree stands like a dancer poised to move with the first note of music.  The ground beneath is cobbled with octagonal stones, tufts of grass sprouting neatly in the cracks.  A single bench beneath the tree faces the ondjai entry screen, its back turned to the courtyard gate."],"exits":[{"to":226,"exit":"go","move":"go courtyard gate"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":253,"x":280,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, A Courtyard","descriptions":["Within the courtyard, a vision of brilliant red, green and yellow colors greets the eye.  Yellow buttercups dot the mown lawn underfoot, and red-lacquered garden benches echo the hue and design of the surrounding fence -- each carved with a dragon or harp upon its back.  The crystals dangling between the fence risers sparkle and gently chime with each gust of wind or swing of the gate."],"exits":[{"to":225,"exit":"go","move":"go wrought gate"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":254,"x":250,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, A Courtyard","descriptions":["A large courtyard is a gathering place for several residences that surround it on three sides.  A gate separates it from the nearby road.  Benches with backs and arms, shaded by a row of birch trees, provide the residents an outdoor sitting room.  In the center of the area, a small fountain chuckles softly as water spills from the pipes that feed it."],"exits":[{"to":224,"exit":"go","move":"go gate"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":255,"x":220,"y":800,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, A Courtyard","descriptions":["Lyrandia vines with deep green tendrils and aromatic, golden flowers twine along the fence and gate that marks the entrance to this courtyard.  The grass is crisscrossed by dirt paths and heavily shaded by a lone hemlock.  A group of boulders rest near the tree, arranged in a loose triangle."],"exits":[{"to":223,"exit":"go","move":"go whitewashed gate"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":256,"x":190,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Chui'mysanda Shyrel'nor Fundisoli","descriptions":["Lush rose bushes fill the air with a heady fragrance in the garden at the center of the school's courtyard.  Young men and women of good families stroll the soft mulched pathways, accompanied by stern duennas to chaperone their behaviour.  A mischievous young man gives you a wink from his perch atop the garden wall."],"exits":[{"to":221,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Charisma"]},
  {"id":257,"x":130,"y":710,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, A Courtyard","descriptions":["A black slate walkway surrounds an area of boxwood greenery.  In the center of the courtyard, silvery flashes of light sparkle amidst the reflected greenery as slender fish rise to the surface of a pebbled pool.  Black benches symmetrically placed on three sides of the harti face the center."],"exits":[{"to":218,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":258,"x":100,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Teshi's Instruments","descriptions":["Toys lie scattered about the slightly dusty wooden floor, and an old cradle rocks silently in the corner.  The walls of the shop are lined with cabinets painted with colorful songbirds.  An old pine workbench stands against the far wall, supporting a half-finished rebec held in place with an assortment of vices.  A chalk-stained leather catalog rests atop the workbench."],"exits":[{"to":217,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Teshi's Instruments","Bardic Shop","Bard Shop"]},
  {"id":259,"x":590,"y":740,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, High Meadow","descriptions":["A crumbling slate cliff drops away sharply below, but a narrow ribbon of pasture land stretches to the northeast and southwest.  Strange scraggly shrubs sprout intermittently among the grasses, as if the wilderness still hopes to reclaim the meadow for itself."],"exits":[{"to":260,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":261,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":243,"exit":"climb","move":"climb trail"}]},
  {"id":260,"x":610,"y":720,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, High Meadow","descriptions":["To the northeast, a collapsed segment of the cliff has cut off passage any further in that direction.  The grass is particularly lush here as though this corner were better protected from harsh winds and winter cold."],"exits":[{"to":259,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":261,"x":520,"y":810,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands","descriptions":["Although the meadowland is rich here, it is but a thin stripe between the abrupt drop below to the north and the opposing steep incline reaching overhead to the south.  A few simple cottages nestle against the black cliffs where the land is the rockiest and the grass cannot quite take grip."],"exits":[{"to":259,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":262,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":262,"x":500,"y":810,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands","descriptions":["Passage west is only by traversing a narrow ledge of ground.  As the drop to the meadowlands below is plummeting, the way is not one for the inattentive.  Some enterprising soul has attempted to build a rough guardrail of sorts, but the occasional stones raining down from the black cliffs above have knocked whole sections completely down."],"exits":[{"to":261,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":263,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow ledge"}]},
  {"id":263,"x":500,"y":790,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highland Ledge","descriptions":["Water seeps in a thready trickle from a crack in the rock, dribbling swiftly away to join the stream gushing from a larger hole below the path.  The rocky ledge extends east and west to meadows tucked beneath steep cliff walls."],"exits":[{"to":264,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":262,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow ledge"},{"to":270,"exit":"go","move":"go stream"}],"aliases":["stream"]},
  {"id":264,"x":440,"y":790,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands","descriptions":["A startlingly rich meadow serves as a common for the roaming sheep.  Cottages with tidy roofs and small flower gardens dot the perimeter -- they are nothing fancy, but obviously kept with pride."],"exits":[{"to":263,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":267,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":266,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":265,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":268,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":265,"x":420,"y":810,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands","descriptions":["Five cottages arranged in a wheel shape crowd a stony area between the meadow and a yawning cave.  In the darkness, the black stone dwarfs the shelters, and the warm light of candles and fires visible from the homes shines brightly against the dark cavity.","Five cottages arranged in a wheel shape crowd a stony area between the meadow and a yawning cave.  The maw in the black stone precipice dwarfs the shelters, creating a dark backdrop to the bright shutters and cheerful flowers planted along the pathway."],"exits":[{"to":264,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":266,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":419,"exit":"go","move":"go cave"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":266,"x":440,"y":810,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands","descriptions":["Backed against the cliff, several carefully kept cottages face the nearby meadow, each with a neat walkway that radiates like a finger of a splayed hand.  A cairn of stones stands at the intersection of the paths."],"exits":[{"to":264,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":267,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":265,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":267,"x":460,"y":810,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands","descriptions":["The rising cliffs to the south overhang several tidy cottages tucked under their shelter.  Flimsy willow fences surround a small garden tended by the inhabitants of the area.  Unless a rock breaks loose and tumbles down upon the hapless cots, this is a pleasant place to dwell, with the grassy lea visible northwards."],"exits":[{"to":266,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":264,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":418,"exit":"go","move":"go garden"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":268,"x":420,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands","descriptions":["The last stretch of grassland ends as the bluffs fall away to meadows far below, or rise straight up to the upper reaches of the island's bowl.  The ruins of a building have been overgrown by the grass and shrubs, but a tower with a conical slate roof still stands at the very edge of the drop-off."],"exits":[{"to":264,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":269,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow trail"},{"to":420,"exit":"go","move":"go tower"}]},
  {"id":269,"x":420,"y":750,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Narrow Ledge","descriptions":["Carved by nature out of the black basalt of the island, the narrow ledge provides a breathtaking view of the city spreading down the hillside below you.  Trees and meadows give way to solid buildings and streets, ending in the misty lake cupped in the bottom of the bowl, with the city rising on all sides around it.  A narrow trail leads up and southward."],"exits":[{"to":268,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow trail"}]},
  {"id":270,"x":500,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands Stream","descriptions":["A dark hole just under the surface of the pooling stream releases a flood of water from beneath the cliff wall.  The temperature is just warm enough to keep it liquid, but it is always icy cold, summer and winter.  Rocky walls on one side lead back up to the ledge.  On the other side, nothing is visible but the tops of shrubs and stunted trees that cling to the sheer slopes."],"exits":[{"to":271,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"},{"to":275,"exit":"go","move":"go hole"},{"to":263,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ledge"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":271,"x":480,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands Stream","descriptions":["Here the waters are the calmest, just before dropping over a small lip to a pool of rough currents below.  The tone of the rapids is high in pitch, and the sheer wall on the northern side reverberates in an echo of pleasant harmony in a song without words."],"exits":[{"to":270,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":272,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":272,"x":460,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands Stream","descriptions":["The deep rapids churn the water collecting in this hollowed basin before continuing down the precipitous slopes.  Trailing vegetation dangles in the water and holds back many of the shards of rock that often rain down from the cliffs above."],"exits":[{"to":271,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":273,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":273,"x":440,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands Stream","descriptions":["The stream gathers force as the banks narrow and channel the rushing water down towards the distant lake below.  Sharp rocks jut into the water and occasional plops disturb the surface as frogs and other creatures venture from shore to stream."],"exits":[{"to":274,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":272,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":274,"x":440,"y":750,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands Stream","descriptions":["High black rock walls rise to either side of the stream, cutting off light and magnifying all sounds.  Narrow and fast, the water disappears into a small crack too narrow for a swimmer, pouring over the cliff edge in a flurry of white spray and mist.  One rocky wall of the stream channel provides just enough hand and footholds to allow a climber to reach the top."],"exits":[{"to":273,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":269,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wall"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":275,"x":500,"y":750,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Underground Spring","descriptions":["The force of the water flowing through the narrow crack is tremendous, pushing against everything in its path.  There is virtually no light, but the walls seem to be formed of rough stone that scrapes roughly at anything that comes into contact with it."],"exits":[{"to":276,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":270,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"}],"color":"#000080"},
  {"id":276,"x":500,"y":730,"z":0,"title":"","descriptions":[],"exits":[{"to":277,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":275,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"}],"color":"#000080"},
  {"id":277,"x":500,"y":710,"z":0,"title":"","descriptions":[],"exits":[{"to":276,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":278,"exit":"up","move":"swim up"}],"color":"#000080"},
  {"id":278,"x":500,"y":690,"z":0,"title":"","descriptions":[],"exits":[{"to":277,"exit":"go","move":"go pool"}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":279,"x":460,"y":470,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Beneath the Prayer Gate","descriptions":["Patterns of light bloom within the glossy black stone of the prayer gate's walls.  Etched in gold on one side, a wounded S'Kra Mur woman sings to a sleeping dragon, her tail held gently above her ankles.  On the other side, the same woman holds a sleeping S'Kra Mur baby in her arms, her tail undulating in the air."],"exits":[{"to":280,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":109,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":280,"x":490,"y":470,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Peri'el Prayer Gate","descriptions":["A grove of white birch trees stands opposite the prayer gate dedicated to the Goddess Peri'el.  Watching over the wild inner slopes to the south, a golden king snake perches atop the gate.  Two guards, taking their duty very seriously, stand to either side of the gate watching those who approach."],"exits":[{"to":279,"exit":"go","move":"go prayer gate"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Auilusi","Grazhir","Ways","Astral Plane"]},
  {"id":281,"x":490,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Woodland Path","descriptions":["A narrow path winds between white birch trees and hemlocks as it climbs up the eastern slope.  Although the streets are but a few steps down the hill, already a peaceful quiet envelops the area, perhaps a result of the trees sheltering the path from the activities below."],"exits":[{"to":282,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":108,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":282,"x":510,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Woodland Path","descriptions":["Fluttering birch leaves and the flexible branchlets of the hemlocks ride the wind with every tug at the delicate silvery foliage.  The earth remains perpetually damp here, and the sweet smell of forest earth rises with every footfall."],"exits":[{"to":283,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":281,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":283,"x":530,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Woodland Path","descriptions":["The path slopes steeply up to the northeast, as it swings round a large storm-damaged hemlock.  The damp soil makes for a slippery ascent, but the drooping branches of the tree work well for holding on."],"exits":[{"to":284,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":282,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":284,"x":550,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Woodland Path","descriptions":["A tall hemlock forces the trail around it, as the footpath continues down to the west and the streets of Surlaenis below.  Creeping cassiope borders the journey eastwards up the slope where the hemlocks outnumber the thinning birches.  The quiet is remarkable -- except for the drip of moisture from tree twigs or rustle of some hidden creature -- the only sounds are those of your own voice and movements."],"exits":[{"to":285,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":283,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":285,"x":570,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Woodland Path","descriptions":["Nothing is visible in any direction but the forest of evergreen hemlocks.  The climb up the eastern slope takes some effort, and requires careful attention to descend safely back down towards the lake, but the frequent switchbacks minimize any need to literally clamber and scale."],"exits":[{"to":286,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":284,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":286,"x":590,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Woodland Path","descriptions":["The footpath ends at a steep bank, and it will be necessary to climb over it to continue.  Roots and shrubs cover the bank, so it is not difficult to scramble up.  A hole in the hillside may likely house some small woodland creature, but there is no sign of its occupant."],"exits":[{"to":285,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":287,"exit":"climb","move":"climb bank"},{"to":391,"exit":"go","move":"kneel;go halfling-sized burrow"}]},
  {"id":287,"x":610,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Woodland Path","descriptions":["The descent to the west is down a steep bank, made manageable by relying on the bushes and roots growing upon it.  The footpath continues to wind eastwardly up the slope.  Three mossy rocks stacked purposefully to one side of the trail could be a marker, but there is no apparent explanation for their arrangement or position."],"exits":[{"to":288,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":286,"exit":"climb","move":"climb bank"}]},
  {"id":288,"x":630,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Woodland Path","descriptions":["A stone altar surrounded by a low hedge of young pruned hemlock trees borders the western edge of the path.  Kneeling at the altar provides a view through a narrow gap in the forest, with a glimpse of the lake and temple steeple aligned in view.  The path continues to descend down the slope to the southwest, and twines around the trees further upwards to the east."],"exits":[{"to":289,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":287,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Murrula"]},
  {"id":289,"x":650,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Woodland Path","descriptions":["The thick tangle of hemlocks thins upon the approach to a clearing at the top of the path's rise.  Within the clearing is a cluster of small buildings, although it is difficult to determine much about them from this point.  Another very narrow trail threads its way over a fallen and rotting trunk straight north, but the encroaching trees quickly hide its destination."],"exits":[{"to":290,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":288,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":292,"exit":"climb","move":"climb trunk"}]},
  {"id":290,"x":670,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Woodland Path","descriptions":["The path follows the steeply angled slant up over the rise of ground to the east.  The area is cleared of trees to afford a view of the open sky, and the hemlocks of the surrounding forest ward a cluster of small buildings built atop the clearing.  Behind them, a sheer cliff of earth rises to even greater heights, as the forest conjoins again to shield whatever might dwell among those palisades.  The trail falls down to the southwest to disappear into those dark, silvery-needled trees."],"exits":[{"to":291,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":289,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":291,"x":690,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Cleric Guild, Outside the Gate","descriptions":["The path ends abruptly at an elegant white iron gate at the entrance to the Cleric's Guild.  Beyond the gate, three small buildings form the familiar Surlaenis U-shape surrounding the courtyard.  Colorful tiger lilies grow on both sides of the entranceway."],"exits":[{"to":290,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":293,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"}]},
  {"id":292,"x":650,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Hemlock Forest","descriptions":["The ground holds puddles of water even in dry weather, where runoff has collected and stagnated.  The hemlock needles float in the shallow, brackish water, hiding it until the gentle splash of a footfall reveals the soggy earth.  The trees crowd close to the trail, allowing only a narrow passage through."],"exits":[{"to":297,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":289,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":293,"x":690,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Cleric Guild, Outer Courtyard","descriptions":["A path composed of white gravel leads from the gate and encircles the entire courtyard.  An enormous fountain made of marble and alabaster stands in the middle of the circular path, the constant sound of trickling water in the air.  The three buildings that make up the Cleric Guild border three sides of the courtyard."],"exits":[{"to":291,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"},{"to":294,"exit":"go","move":"go innu door"},{"to":295,"exit":"go","move":"go bamboo door"}]},
  {"id":294,"x":680,"y":450,"z":0,"title":"Cleric Guild, Innu's Quarters","descriptions":["The guild leader Innu's quarters are long and narrow, with a cot just visible at the back behind a heavy curtain.  Her desk near the door is rather bare, except for a neat parchment and a cloth she uses for polishing weapons.  The wall is hung with some nice examples of used weapons -- a broadsword, a heavy hammer, and a battered ebony crossbow."],"exits":[{"to":293,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Cleric","Innu","RS Cleric"]},
  {"id":295,"x":700,"y":450,"z":0,"title":"Cleric Guild, Communal Room","descriptions":["Potted ferns stand in each corner of this main gathering place of the guild.  The thin screen walls are delicately flecked with embedded gold paint.  Elegant candle holders made from a highly polished brass sit on tables throughout the room, each one holding a lit candle.  Pillows upon the floor allow some comfort from the hard ground."],"exits":[{"to":296,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":293,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":296,"x":700,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Cleric Guild, Prayer Room","descriptions":["A black alabaster altar stands at the far end of the room, flanked on both sides by two exquisite candelabras almost as tall as a Human.  Each candelabra holds five candles, their flickering light reflecting in the glossy surface of the altar.  A few clerics sit by the altar, their heads bowed in silent prayer."],"exits":[{"to":295,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Meraud"]},
  {"id":297,"x":650,"y":400,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Hemlock Forest","descriptions":["Young saplings crowd the undergrowth of the forest and create a dense mesh of vegetation impenetrable except where the trail forces its way through.  No animal, or even insect life, stirs about.  The only sound is the lulling whisper of hemlock needles as the branches sway in gentle winds high overhead."],"exits":[{"to":298,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":292,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":298,"x":650,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Hemlock Forest","descriptions":["A shallow ditch cuts across the path and runs along beside the trail a short distance until it plunges out of sight into the forest growth to the west.  This gully, dug by rainfall and melting snows, channels its way to the lake below, and puddles remain on the saturated ground even in dry weather."],"exits":[{"to":299,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":297,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":299,"x":670,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Hemlock Forest","descriptions":["In the shadow of the steep cliff rising to the north, the hemlocks grow close together, their branches entwined and woven in a matted mass of snarls.  The sky is barely visible overhead and only a wan light penetrates to the needle-covered forest floor.  The distant sound of tumbling rocks ricochets dully off the cliff face high overhead where something climbs, or falls."],"exits":[{"to":300,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":298,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":300,"x":670,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Hemlock Forest","descriptions":["The narrow trail plunges on into the dense trees, weaving amongst the scented, drooping branches.  The smaller trees show scars where the bark was stripped away, either by a gnawing animal, or cut and harvested for medicinal uses."],"exits":[{"to":301,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":299,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":301,"x":690,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Bottom of Cliff","descriptions":["A cliff rises overhead as the northeastern slope of the island sweeps upwards at an impossible angle.  The initial climb up is a mixture of earth and protruding rocks, but not far overhead is a broken face of red-veined dark stone.  Hemlock trees crowd right to the base of the cliff, a few smaller specimens even encroaching up the lower reaches of the ascent."],"exits":[{"to":300,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":302,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ledge"}]},
  {"id":302,"x":690,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Cliff","descriptions":["This ledge is just high enough to see over the hemlock forest below and beyond to the far side of the lake.  Gusts of wind sweep across the tops of the trees, appearing for all the world like a sea of silvery green waves shifting and swelling.  A thin ledge overhead is accessible by the protruding roots in the soil and cracks in the projecting rocks that may serve as handholds."],"exits":[{"to":303,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ledge"},{"to":301,"exit":"climb","move":"climb way down"}]},
  {"id":303,"x":690,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Cliff","descriptions":["This long thin ledge provides little room for movement.  A flat rock juts out overhead and another ledge appears within reach below -- either option seems safer than lingering here.  A scuttering sound scratches over the rocks as some unseen creature darts safely out of sight."],"exits":[{"to":304,"exit":"climb","move":"climb rock"},{"to":302,"exit":"climb","move":"climb lower ledge"}]},
  {"id":304,"x":690,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Cliff","descriptions":["A huge dark rock juts out from the cliff face and offers a comfortable resting point before continuing to climb.  A clump of burr-weeds grows from a crevice and thrashes against the hard surface of the rock with a raspy whisper as the wind whips across the cliff."],"exits":[{"to":305,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":303,"exit":"climb","move":"climb thin ledge"}]},
  {"id":305,"x":690,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Cliff","descriptions":["At the juncture of the rock and the cliff, long cracks mar the vertical face.  Some of these cracks are almost wide enough to squeeze into, but the weather has created enough chinks to assist a climb up to another rocky perch above.  A constant drip, drip comes from somewhere within the cracks."],"exits":[{"to":304,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":306,"exit":"climb","move":"climb rock perch"}]},
  {"id":306,"x":690,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, A High Perch","descriptions":["Deep vertical cracks, like gashed wounds, continue up and down the cliff face.  This perch offers little protection from the wind and weather that can pound against the cliff wall.  Bits of rock crumble and fall with each movement -- at this height, the climb is not one for the inexperienced.  A rock shelf is visible even higher above."],"exits":[{"to":307,"exit":"climb","move":"climb rock shelf"},{"to":305,"exit":"climb","move":"climb way down"}]},
  {"id":307,"x":690,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Cliff","descriptions":["Barely a third of the way up the cliff, this shelf cut from the rock is wide enough to comfortably pause upon.  Scraggly bushes, leafless with wooly stems, cling to every crack deep enough to hold a spoonful of sandy soil.  A long horizontal crevice slices through the rock overhead, and appears to be deep enough to crawl inside."],"exits":[{"to":308,"exit":"climb","move":"climb narrow crevice"},{"to":306,"exit":"climb","move":"climb rock shelf"}]},
  {"id":308,"x":690,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Cliff","descriptions":["The crevice slants back deeply into the face of the cliff and cradles you safely within.  Towards the back, an arched tunnel bores through the rock to the west.  A few animal droppings and a tuft of fur caught on a burr-bush reveal other creatures have sought shelter here as well."],"exits":[{"to":309,"exit":"go","move":"go tunnel"},{"to":307,"exit":"climb","move":"climb way down"}]},
  {"id":309,"x":610,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Cliff","descriptions":["The western side of the deep crevice ends abruptly.  Any misstep and it's a long, long fall.  A crumbling ledge above is the only way up -- otherwise, an arched tunnel leads back to the eastern side of the crevice and the alternative route down."],"exits":[{"to":310,"exit":"climb","move":"climb crumbling ledge"},{"to":308,"exit":"go","move":"go tunnel"}]},
  {"id":310,"x":610,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Cliff","descriptions":["Chunks of rock fall with every movement -- this ledge does not appear to be stable at all.  Small spider webs glint within the fracturing stone, creating the illusion of silver threads tying the dark, disintegrating chunks of rock together.  Above, a shallow crevice is an even darker stain upon the black rock."],"exits":[{"to":311,"exit":"climb","move":"climb shallow crevice"},{"to":309,"exit":"climb","move":"climb way down"}]},
  {"id":311,"x":610,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Cliff","descriptions":["This shallow crevice offers minimal protection from the wind, and a view, with a hefty dose of vertigo, of the terrain below.  Within the crevice, dark red veins streak the black rock, and gusts of wind blow gritty sand in little swirls.  Above, you can see a round hole in the cliff face."],"exits":[{"to":312,"exit":"climb","move":"climb hole"},{"to":310,"exit":"climb","move":"climb way down"}]},
  {"id":312,"x":610,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Cliff","descriptions":["This large hole is just one climb away from the top of the cliff.  However, very few cracks in the rock are in the right places for holding on, and the wind is especially brisk and strong here.  Some dirty straw tucked within one corner of the hole resembles an untidy nest."],"exits":[{"to":313,"exit":"climb","move":"climb cliff top"},{"to":311,"exit":"climb","move":"climb crevice"}]},
  {"id":313,"x":610,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Top of Cliff","descriptions":["At the top of the cliff, very little vegetation thrives.  A few scraggly tree-like bushes, with short thick needles, rock in the strong wind gusts, and some grey blotches of lichen stain the dark red rocks.  Jagged basalt boulders litter the top and rise further north in a second cliff, more perilous than the climb below."],"exits":[{"to":314,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":312,"exit":"climb","move":"climb hole"}]},
  {"id":314,"x":590,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Cliff Trail","descriptions":["A trail snakes between the barren rocks -- here is a cold and lifeless terrain.  The hiss of wind is constant, the stone hard underfoot.  Grit and sand swirls over the landscape, scratching a forlorn plea in the lonely quiet."],"exits":[{"to":315,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":313,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":315,"x":610,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Cliff Trail","descriptions":["A lime-green creeping plant is startling in the barren soil and sand.  Its tiny leaves stand out brightly against the dark ground.  Except for this one patch of green, all else is dark and bare.  The wind thrums along, a constant companion, day and night."],"exits":[{"to":316,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":314,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":316,"x":610,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Cliff Trail","descriptions":["Columnar basalt formations, octagonal in shape and in varying heights, rise off to the west.  Arranged like giant steps, the phenomena has a comical appearance, but otherwise it is more rock in a place of rocks."],"exits":[{"to":317,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":315,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":317,"x":630,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, High Cliffs","descriptions":["A pile of old bones lies at the base of the high cliffs.  Clearly some animal has scavenged and picked them clean of any identifying features.  A slanting ledge scales up the bluff, although the ascent looks treacherous.  Care and skill are required to prevent the same fatal outcome as the poor creature whose remains are as cold and bare as this land."],"exits":[{"to":316,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":318,"exit":"climb","move":"climb slant ledge"}]},
  {"id":318,"x":630,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, High Cliffs","descriptions":["The ledge slants steeply down to the west.  Between the slope and the wind, merely staying in one place is difficult.  A cantilevered ledge overhead, if reachable, appears to be a more practical spot to make decisions about the next stage of the journey."],"exits":[{"to":319,"exit":"climb","move":"climb cantilevered ledge"},{"to":317,"exit":"climb","move":"climb way down"}]},
  {"id":319,"x":630,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, High Cliffs","descriptions":["Ice crystal needles fill the cracks in the surface of the ledge.  Cold air sinks from above, yet the sudden chill is unexplainable.  Although the wind gusts are freezing and the height considerable, the year 'round snow of the rim is still far, far above this point.  Closer inspection proves the ice sprouts from within the rock, as the deeper fissures hold larger chunks of ice and frost."],"exits":[{"to":320,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wide ledge"},{"to":318,"exit":"climb","move":"climb slanting ledge"}]},
  {"id":320,"x":630,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, High Cliffs","descriptions":["A fine white frost covers all surfaces of the basalt, the red streaks in the rock taking on a pinkish cast beneath the filmy rime.  Patterns splay over the surface like giant snowflakes as the strange ice grows in crystaline formations.  A ledge, slippery with more ice, is visible even further up the cliff."],"exits":[{"to":321,"exit":"climb","move":"climb slippery ledge"},{"to":319,"exit":"climb","move":"climb cantilevered ledge"}]},
  {"id":321,"x":630,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, High Cliffs Ledge","descriptions":["Icicles cling to the crags and fill the clefts in the cliff, with perhaps a single drop of water slowly sliding off to fall below.  Tiny tundra-like mosses grow beneath the icicles' drip, blotching the ledge with yellow-green and red spores from the blooming plants.  Once safely up to this point, one discovers a deep fracture running vertically through the rock.  There does not appear to be any way to climb further up, so the choices at this point are either to descend or attempt to explore the fissure."],"exits":[{"to":322,"exit":"go","move":"go deep fracture"},{"to":320,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wide ledge"}]},
  {"id":322,"x":530,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Geshiger","descriptions":["Daggers of ice drip from the top of a fissure and sparkle as the light beyond strikes the fragile surfaces.  Inside the rock cavity, which drops sharply a few yards forward, the walls, floor and ceiling are all coated with a powdery rimefrost."],"exits":[{"to":323,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":321,"exit":"go","move":"go fissure"}]},
  {"id":323,"x":530,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Geshiger","descriptions":["This cave within the rock is freezing cold!  Ice coats the jagged rock formations with refracting crystals, as if a coarse, heavy snow had blown through.  Powdery slush sloshes underfoot, while a blast of even colder air blows in from around a bend to the northwest."],"exits":[{"to":324,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":322,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":324,"x":510,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Geshiger","descriptions":["The cave roof slopes down sharply to meet the ground to the northwest.  In one cramped corner is a narrow slit leading further into the bowels of the rock, the opening crusted with broken fangs of ice."],"exits":[{"to":323,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":325,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow slit"}]},
  {"id":325,"x":510,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Geshiger","descriptions":["Smooth ice veils the cave walls and floor, filling in the cracks and rounding the sharp edges of rock.  An iron ladder affixed to the west wall is also coated in a film of ice and ascends into a dark passage above.  Clumps of ice break from the ceiling above and hit the slick floor below with a loud *crack*."],"exits":[{"to":324,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":326,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"}]},
  {"id":326,"x":490,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Geshiger","descriptions":["The walls of the cave are pocked with indentations, grooves and clefts.  Frigid air seeps from them, and the moisture in the air snap freezes to dusty particles of ice.  A faint tinkling must be the sound of that vapor solidifying and falling like glitter dust to the powder-coated floor."],"exits":[{"to":327,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":325,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"}]},
  {"id":327,"x":490,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Geshiger","descriptions":["Spears of ice as thick as a 'Tog's arm hang from chunks of rock overhead.  All surfaces are permanently coated in the ice which has taken on a sickeningly bluish tint.  A faint chemical smell, unidentifiable, but most certainly unpleasant, pervades the air."],"exits":[{"to":329,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":326,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":328,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":328,"x":470,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Geshiger","descriptions":["The journey into the rock ends here in a featureless tomb of smooth grey ice.  No rock is visible at all, everything now slicked with the frozen glaze.  Breath freezes instantly with each exhalation in a tiny explosion of icy sparks."],"exits":[{"to":327,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":329,"x":510,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Geshiger","descriptions":["Frost-shattered rock, sprinkled with powdery white crystals, litters the floor.  The walls are crumbling from the freeze and thaw of moisture that threads through the network of fractures.  A steady melting of ice from within the rock slides down the frozen walls and trickles thinly down a slope deeper into the cavern.  In patches, the rivulet has refrozen into ice slicks likely to send the unwary sliding into the dark below."],"exits":[{"to":327,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":330,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":330,"x":530,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Geshiger","descriptions":["Water oozes down the slope of the cave's floor, most of it refrozen into an icy slide.  A chuckle of water spilling over rock resounds through the air, but the source of it out of sight.  The northern wall is a solid, smooth surface of dark red rock splattered with a craze of frost."],"exits":[{"to":329,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":331,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":331,"x":550,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Geshiger","descriptions":["Enough water collected here at one time to cover the floor and has since frozen into a solid pool of ice.  Smooth as a mirror, it reflects light with a sparkle.  The icy pattern of frost creeps over the walls in a swirling design, but the bitter cold and pervasive dark beyond belies the beauty of ice and rock."],"exits":[{"to":332,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":330,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":332,"x":550,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Geshiger","descriptions":["A niche at the far end of the wall is filled with the powdery frost.  Thin wires run over the opening like a web, and icicles dangle from the wires in a scalloped formation.  A cold, cold wind gushes up from cracks in the floor making it difficult to get enough breath to speak."],"exits":[{"to":331,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":333,"x":530,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis","descriptions":["A thin path winds its way from the top of the stairs through the grounds of the necropolis.  The glossy black tile roof of a mausoleum is visible in the distance, though the weeping willow trees which line the path obstruct the view of most of the building.  Freshly planted flowers grow in colorful profusion throughout the area."],"exits":[{"to":334,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":199,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stone stair"}]},
  {"id":334,"x":550,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis","descriptions":["Octagonal white bricks are fitted tightly together to form the path which leads from the top of the stairs to the main cemetery.  A narrow trail covered with grey marble gravel branches off toward a nearby mausoleum.  Meandering clusters of vibrant yellow tulips are planted alongside the path."],"exits":[{"to":335,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":333,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":369,"exit":"go","move":"go trail"}]},
  {"id":335,"x":570,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis","descriptions":["The white octagonal brick path winds through carefully tended flowerbeds toward the main cemetery.  Nearby, weeping willows spread their branches protectively over a secluded sitting area, shading some benches and providing visitors respite from the elements.  Though some of the bricks are broken, and moss grows between the cracks, the overall impression is one of peace."],"exits":[{"to":336,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":334,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":336,"x":590,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis","descriptions":["To the northeast, the main gate of the cemetery is barely visible through a copse of dogwood trees.  A peaceful calm permeates the area as a soft breeze gently floats through the trees.  The lawns here are a deep plush green grass that is well tended and soft to the touch."],"exits":[{"to":337,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":335,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":337,"x":610,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis","descriptions":["The white brick path stops at an ornate fence that encircles the necropolis.  Made of black and white iron rods, the fence is broken by an elaborately wrought gate.  Beyond the gate, the brick path spirals off deeper into the cemetery, winding amongst the headstones."],"exits":[{"to":336,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":338,"exit":"go","move":"go gate"}]},
  {"id":338,"x":640,"y":730,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["Sweeping green lawns are well manicured and lovingly tended.  Leading into the distance, graceful headstones sport combinations of delicately scrawled words, stone cherubs, symbols and gargoyles.  The deep green of the grass contrasts with the light green of the ferns planted between some of the grave markers.  The fragrance of the flowers left by loved ones mingles with that of the blooming dogwoods, while weeping willows shade the tombstones.","Sweeping green lawns are well manicured and lovingly tended.  Leading into the distance, headstones cast shadows across the dark green grass.  The fragrance of flowers drifts on the breeze, and weeping willows drape their branches over the tombstones."],"exits":[{"to":339,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":337,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"}]},
  {"id":339,"x":670,"y":730,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The white brick path forks off towards the northeast and northwest beginning its complete circle around the necropolis.  Several headstones lie alongside the path, including a heart-shaped one which attests to a couple who are joined in death as they were in life, while next to it, a tiny marker has been etched with the image of a smiling baby.  The sweet fragrance of the fresh cut flowers which decorate the headstones fills the air.","The white brick path forks off towards the northeast and northwest to encircle the necropolis.  Several headstones lie alongside the path, including a heart-shaped one which attests to a couple who are joined in death as they were in life, while next to it, a tiny marker has been etched with the image of a smiling baby.  The flowers that decorated the headstones are faded and rotting with a dark smeared slime."],"exits":[{"to":351,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":338,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":340,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":340,"x":650,"y":710,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The path curves southeast toward the entrance to the necropolis.  A break in the oak and willow trees along the walk provides a view of the mausoleum's black tile roof towards the southwest.  The grass is lush and green, with rows of headstones marking the final homes of the island's residents.","The path curves southeast toward the entrance to the necropolis.  The black tile roof of a mausoleum stands silhouetted in a gap in the trees along the walk.  The grass between the rows of headstones is dark and slick with wetness."],"exits":[{"to":341,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":339,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":341,"x":650,"y":690,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The path continues its way around the necropolis, weaving through row after row of marble headstones.  The sound of a brook beyond some nearby oak trees breaks the peaceful quiet, and a bed of flowers provides a splash of vibrant color against the deep green lawn.","The path continues its way around the necropolis, weaving through row after row of marble headstones.  A brook gurgles in the darkness, and the overly sweet smell of flowers mingles with a scent of decay."],"exits":[{"to":342,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":340,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":342,"x":650,"y":670,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The deep green lawn is well cared for, the grass thick and lush underfoot.  Modest grey slate markers adorn most of the graves, but a few ostentatious gilt-trimmed white alabaster monuments are scattered here and there.  Weeping willows stand over the path, their long branches blowing in a soft breeze."],"exits":[{"to":343,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":341,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":343,"x":650,"y":650,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The bridge over the small pond is visible in the distance as the white brick path wends its way through the necropolis.  A freshly dug hole awaits yet another islander who has recently crossed over to the starry road."],"exits":[{"to":344,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":342,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":344,"x":650,"y":630,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["At a bend in the path, a square tomb stands shaded by a young willow tree.  The stone is dusty and stained with watermarks forlornly patterned like tear drops spilled upon it.  The tree branches scrape against it in the wind, neither a screech nor a sigh, but the sound is unsettling."],"exits":[{"to":345,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":343,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":345,"x":670,"y":610,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["Headstones run in neat rows, the dates in the inscriptions indicating that those who rest here are among the most recent arrivals in the necropolis.  Neat rectangles of bare dirt covered by wilting flowers mark the newly interred, their headstones lying beside the grave awaiting the mason and his helpers to set them into place."],"exits":[{"to":346,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":344,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":346,"x":750,"y":610,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["A gentle breeze is the only discernible movement in this quiet part of the cemetery.  Soft grass blankets the ground around the older headstones of those buried long ago.  The graves are aged, but still very well maintained.  The scent of honeysuckle from the nearby vines fills the air."],"exits":[{"to":347,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":345,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":352,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"}]},
  {"id":347,"x":750,"y":630,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["A shovel and pickaxe lie tumbled upon the grass at the edge of a half-dug grave.  Fresh flowers, their petals scattered by careless feet, sprawl amidst the broken ruins of clay pots.  Nearby, a chisel is half-buried in the soft earth beneath an overturned headstone."],"exits":[{"to":346,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":348,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":348,"x":750,"y":650,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["Two sprawling weeping willow trees loom over the path like sentinels on watch.  Nearby, flowers are placed at the foot of a freshly dug grave, the dirt packed back in to cover the occupant of the hole.  Granite headstones, aligned in evenly spaced rows, cast shadows across the lawn.","Two sprawling weeping willow trees loom over the path like sentinels on watch.  Dirt piles border a freshly dug grave only partially filled with dirt.  Granite headstones, aligned in evenly spaced rows, cast shadows across the lawn."],"exits":[{"to":347,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":349,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":349,"x":730,"y":670,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The sound of trickling water comes from a nearby marble fountain surrounded by a bed of delicate white daisies.  Some of the daisies have fallen victim to mourners that have picked them to place at the grave of their loved ones.","The sound of trickling water comes from a nearby marble fountain surrounded by a bed of daisies.  Some of the daisies are trampled and uprooted, and the earth scratched and furrowed."],"exits":[{"to":348,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":350,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":350,"x":710,"y":690,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["Torches line the brick path winding its way through the neatly tended headstones.  A mound of dirt lies next to the beginnings of a freshly-made hole, soon to be a tomb to house yet another resident."],"exits":[{"to":349,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":351,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":351,"x":690,"y":710,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The sorrowful song of the mourning dove drifts over the picturesque greenery.  Neat paths wind their way through the lawns, while benches are tucked discreetly beneath sheltering trees.  A marbled-granite gargoyle rests gently upon a large slab of granite marking the remains of one of the islanders.","The call of a night bird erupts in the distance.  Paths wind through the lawns, and benches lurk beneath veiling trees.  A marbled-granite gargoyle rests gently upon a large slab of granite marking the remains of one of the islanders."],"exits":[{"to":350,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":339,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":352,"x":750,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["Grass overgrows sections of the path as it winds deeper through the necropolis.  Some of the headstones are hundreds of years old and worn from the water and freezing rains of passing generations.  Not a single inscription upon them is readable."],"exits":[{"to":353,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":368,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":346,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"}]},
  {"id":353,"x":770,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The lawn abounds with weeds that even cover some of the tombstones beneath their tangling growth.  The branches of surrounding willow trees meet the tall, unmown grass in a clumsy bow."],"exits":[{"to":354,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":352,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":354,"x":790,"y":540,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["Weeping willows, planted long ago, now stand tall, their outstretched branches allowing little view of the skies above.  The headstones, thickly clustered along this part of the necropolis, are cracked from age and neglect."],"exits":[{"to":353,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":355,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":355,"x":770,"y":520,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The willow trees thin out a bit, enough to allow a glimpse of the sky above.  Thickly growing grass, of several different varieties to judge by the variations in color and texture, carpets the ground around you, broken only by tiny purple-tipped white flowers.  Moss-covered headstones, some cracked and broken, line the area -- one of them a massive monument, large enough to mark the grave of an entire family."],"exits":[{"to":354,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":356,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":356,"x":750,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["Beneath the branches of a gnarled oak tree, a long wooden bench provides a place to meditate, or just to rest.  The whiteness of the path is broken by low growing weeds and moss which peek through crevices between the octagonal bricks.  Once carefully tended, wildflowers now grow amidst the unpruned rose bushes in a nearby flower bed, the blossoms filling the air with a fresh, sweet scent.","A gnarled oak shadows a long wooden bench.  The silhouettes of thorny rose bushes and the pattern of weeds growing between the cracks in the path create a sharp contrast of pale and dark.  Sounds of distant voices carry on the wind, but there is no clue as to where these indistinct sounds originate."],"exits":[{"to":355,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":357,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":357,"x":730,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["Across the necropolis, sunlight glints off the surface of the pond, visible between the trees which shade the white brick path.  Low headstones cluster closely amidst the overgrown grass, covered with a thin layer of moss and worn by time and weather.","Across the necropolis, moonlight glints off the surface of the pond, visible between the trees which shade the white brick path.  Low headstones cluster closely amidst the overgrown grass, covered with a thin layer of moss and worn by time and weather."],"exits":[{"to":356,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":358,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":358,"x":730,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["A soft breeze rustles the leaves of the trees, breaking the stillness.  One lone headstone stands underneath a willow tree, crudely chiseled into a half-circle, its surface smoothed over by years of exposure to the elements."],"exits":[{"to":357,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":359,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":359,"x":730,"y":520,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["Against a canvas of green grass, a tall, elegant vase of exotic lilies leans against a simple headstone.  A small patch of grass is matted to the ground where someone had been kneeling.  The subtle scent of the lilies dances in the air of a soft breeze.","A tall vase of lilies lies knocked on its side near a simple headstone.  The grass is uprooted and marred with long scratch marks, but the subtle scent of lilies dances in the air of a soft breeze."],"exits":[{"to":358,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":360,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":360,"x":710,"y":520,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The path winds through a copse of slender birch trees, the mottled white bark a pallid contrast to the deep green grass of the lawn.  A couple of wrens perch amidst the leaves of the tree, their heads tilted slightly as they survey passers-by with a watchful eye.","The path winds through a copse of slender birch trees, the mottled white bark a pallid contrast to the dark grass.  The trees tremble and shudder with every gust of breeze, their leaves and twigs in a dancing frenzy."],"exits":[{"to":359,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":361,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":361,"x":680,"y":490,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The once-neat lawn is overgrown with dandelions and other weeds in the far corner of the burial grounds.  Thin headstones of dark grey slate are canted at odd angles, half-hidden amidst the greenery.  Several markers near the base of a gnarled oak tree have toppled, pushed over by the gradual yet insistent pressure of its roots.","Dandelions and scraggly weeds claim the lawn here in the farthest corner of the grounds.  Thin headstones of dark grey slate are canted at severe angles, nearly hidden in the ragged greenery.  Several markers near the base of an oak tree lie toppled, with moist scars of earth at their bases."],"exits":[{"to":360,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":362,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":362,"x":650,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["Weeds sprout throughout the lawn, yet the bricked path is surprisingly free of growth.  Few headstones survive here, and the ones which do, are worn by the weather or cracked and broken by vandals... or worse."],"exits":[{"to":361,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":363,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":363,"x":650,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The soil is rocky and coarse, and what grass there is, is thin and scraggly.  The path begins to slope downward to the south, heading towards the main entrance."],"exits":[{"to":362,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":364,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":364,"x":650,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["A dirt trail ends here where it meets the bricked path, with the paved path leading back into the trees to the north.  Down the slope, the trail winds towards the grounds' pond and gate.  The grassless soil is hard and rocky -- too hard for digging graves.  With little to break the view, the eastern slope of the island, blanketed with a dark evergreen forest, rises abruptly towards the heights of the island's rim.","A dirt trail ends here where it meets the bricked path, with the paved path leading back into the trees to the north.  Down the slope, the trail winds towards the grounds' pond and gate.  The grassless soil is hard and rocky, but broken by scratches and furrows dug into the ungiving ground.  The dark forested eastern slope rises as a backdrop against this treeless section of the necropolis."],"exits":[{"to":363,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":365,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":365,"x":650,"y":520,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The trail climbs the slope, and is steep enough here to be slippery in wet weather and slick with dust and grit on dry days.  A single clump of weeds grows around a large boulder, the only landmark nearby."],"exits":[{"to":364,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":366,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":366,"x":650,"y":540,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["At the base of a hill, a dirt path climbs upwards to another section of the grounds.  The white octagonal tiles of the paved walk, here dulled to a dingy shade of grey from the eroded soil of the barren hillside, carry the path on to the southwest.  A gap in the bordering trees provides a glimpse of the lavish lawns and rows of headstones plentiful below.","At the base of a hill, a dirt path climbs upwards to another section of the grounds.  The white octagonal tiles of the paved walk, here dulled to a dingy shade of grey from the eroded soil of the barren hillside, carry the path on to the southwest.  The bordering trees creak and sway in the darkness as some unseen animal forages and stirs beneath the concealing shadows."],"exits":[{"to":367,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":365,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":367,"x":630,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["The lawn is covered by a deep green carpet of grass, virtually untouched by any worker's spade.  A few headstones are scattered here and there, marking the graves of recently deceased islanders, but for the most part, this area remains unpopulated."],"exits":[{"to":366,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":368,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":368,"x":650,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Final Resting Place","descriptions":["An onyx tombstone, carved with a panther and trimmed with polished gold leaf, attests to the riches acquired by the mage buried here.  The panther crouches, ready to attack anyone who might disturb its master's eternal rest."],"exits":[{"to":352,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":367,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":369,"x":510,"y":660,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Outside the Mausoleum","descriptions":["The trail leads up to the entrance of the mausoleum.  Highly polished white marble columns on either side of the entrance support a small overhang that shades the doorway.  A glossy black tile roof protects the occupants from the elements, completing the simple elegance of the structure."],"exits":[{"to":334,"exit":"go","move":"go winding trail"},{"to":370,"exit":"go","move":"go mausoleum"}],"aliases":["Aalar"]},
  {"id":370,"x":510,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Mausoleum Grand Foyer","descriptions":["Polished floors made from black marble reflect the light emanating from several candles placed in tall brass candelabras.  Two divans rest against the far wall underneath a large painting of the inner lake.  An arched doorway made of carved oak leads into the gela oleni, or the main burial chambers."],"exits":[{"to":369,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":371,"exit":"go","move":"go arched doorway"}]},
  {"id":371,"x":510,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Gela Oleni","descriptions":["Walls of black marble shine with such a high gloss, reflections are seen with almost crystal clarity.  Images of flowers are etched into portions of the marble, and grooves are cut at evenly spaced intervals, outlining each individual resting place.  Each grave is a large two foot square, just enough room to hold the urn of a resident.  A door, made from the same marble as the walls, stands slightly ajar."],"exits":[{"to":370,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":372,"exit":"go","move":"go marble door"}]},
  {"id":372,"x":510,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a Mausoleum, Behind the Door","descriptions":["The only thing visible in the dark is a staircase that leads down to the cellar of the mausoleum.  Faint sounds echo below, disturbing the silence with restless tones and thumps."],"exits":[{"to":371,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":373,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"}]},
  {"id":373,"x":510,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a Mausoleum, Crematorium","descriptions":["The room is dark and windowless.  The only means of light is one lone candle that flickers in the far corner.  A large steel oven, its doors slightly ajar, takes up almost all of the floor space.  A faint smell of something indistinguishable fills the air, unpleasant to the nose.  An occasional bumping sound appears to come from the general direction of the far wall."],"exits":[{"to":372,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"},{"to":374,"exit":"go","move":"push wall;-3 go wall"}]},
  {"id":374,"x":550,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["The tunnels branch off into several directions, leading deeper into the unknown.  Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the marble wall that leads back out towards the cellar.  Indistinguishable sounds echo throughout the darkness, coming from all directions."],"exits":[{"to":375,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":378,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":379,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":380,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":373,"exit":"none","move":"go wall"}]},
  {"id":375,"x":550,"y":520,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":376,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":374,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":376,"x":570,"y":520,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":377,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":378,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":375,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":377,"x":590,"y":540,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":378,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":376,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":378,"x":570,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":376,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":377,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":381,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":379,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":374,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":379,"x":570,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":378,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":381,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":380,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":374,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":380,"x":570,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":379,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":381,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":374,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":382,"exit":"go","move":"go arched doorway"}]},
  {"id":381,"x":590,"y":580,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":380,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":379,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":378,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":382,"x":570,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":383,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":385,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":387,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":380,"exit":"go","move":"go arched door"}]},
  {"id":383,"x":590,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":384,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":382,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":384,"x":590,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":383,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":385,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":385,"x":570,"y":640,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":382,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":384,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":386,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":386,"x":550,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":387,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":385,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":388,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":387,"x":550,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":382,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":386,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":388,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":388,"x":530,"y":600,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Necropolis Tunnels","descriptions":["Ancient S'Kra symbols are carved into the tunnel walls in a continuous line, their meaning indecipherable to the common eye.  The darkness of the tunnel is broken by a single lantern that casts just enough light to make traveling through the tunnels easier."],"exits":[{"to":387,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":386,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":389,"x":20,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Beneath the Prayer Gate","descriptions":["Smooth mother-of-pearl walls rise to form a gentle arch above.  Mosaics of interlocking shells form images of life beneath Elanthia's oceans.  Blue-grey dolphins frolic among sea-green waves as gentle merfolk herd schools of fish into nets of woven kelp.  To the east, the Staho Pivo'hrr'schu'Mus leads into the city proper."],"exits":[{"to":91,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":390,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":390,"x":0,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Eluned Prayer Gate","descriptions":["Gentle terraces of tilled earth rise to the west, leading towards the Selhin Dava.  A large prayer gate, watched over by two guards, stands as the only demarcation between the inner slope and the city.  Dedicated to Eluned of the Waters, the prayer gate bears an anloral sculpture of a leaping dolphin at its peak."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["West"],"linksTo":"Map98_Road_to_Aesry.xml"},
  {"id":391,"x":590,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"The Slings and Arrows of Outrageous Fortune","descriptions":["Roomier within than it appears from the outside, colorful braided wool rugs cover the dirt floor of this tiny burrow.  A bent-twig stool, held together by horsehair strands, provides seating for the young Halfling man carving bowstaves behind the split birch log which serves as a counter.  Woven reed baskets hold an assortment of slings, while wooden barrels store staff slings and bowstaves for customers to peruse."],"exits":[{"to":286,"exit":"go","move":"kneel;go small opening;stand"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Slings and Arrows of Outrageous Fortune","Woodbyne","bows","crossbows","arrows","bolts"]},
  {"id":392,"x":460,"y":410,"z":0,"title":"Fang Cove, Fate's Fortune Lane","descriptions":["A towering marble archway opens a gap in the wall to the north and separates the ongoing construction and somewhat more refined completed structures of Fate's Fortune Lane from the crude structures and makeshift walkway along the beach.  The entrance to a squat, wide bungalow sits in opposition to the arch, and the sheltering cliffs of Fang's Peak rise up from behind it.  To either side of the arch, cobblestones of different shapes and sizes have been laid out to form the wide Fate's Fortune Lane."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":0,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":0,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":89,"exit":"go","move":"go exit portal"}],"linksTo":"Map150_Fang_Cove.xml"},
  {"id":393,"x":60,"y":470,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Inn Stables","descriptions":["A green swath of grass, neatly clipped, forms a small lawn in front of a compact but clean and well-kept stable tucked beside the Inn.  The path back to the street is hard-packed dirt sprinkled with clean straw, and lined along each edge with a row of grey cobblestones."],"exits":[{"to":394,"exit":"go","move":"go stable"},{"to":93,"exit":"go","move":"go dirt path"}]},
  {"id":394,"x":60,"y":490,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Inn Stables","descriptions":["Huge skylights cut in the tiled roof reflect the light from several lanterns hanging from the rafters, softly illuminating the quiet rows of wooden stalls.  A few stable boys are still about, ready to tend the horses of late-coming guests, and their conversation mingles with the soft sounds of sleepy horses stamping the straw-covered earthen floor."],"exits":[{"to":393,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":395,"x":20,"y":490,"z":0,"title":"Inn of the Crystal Wave, Courtyard","descriptions":["Carved driftwood benches cluster around the huge bole of an ancient tree, its thick overhead branches and broad leaves deflecting rain and weather.  A crushed-shell pathway encircles the trunk and leads up to a grand doorway at the far end of the courtyard, sheltered by a generously overhanging blue-tiled roof.  The substantial exterior beams supporting the roof are carved with mingled Elothean and Elven script so that the effect is more of pattern and shape than discernible words."],"exits":[{"to":93,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":396,"exit":"go","move":"go grand doorway"}]},
  {"id":396,"x":10,"y":490,"z":0,"title":"Inn of the Crystal Wave, Entry Hall","descriptions":["The ceiling soars high overhead, a puzzle of crossing and joined beams, brightly illuminated by glass and polished brass lanterns hung at regular intervals.  The floor is crystalline-etched in swirling patterns that give the impression of sea foam.  Low planters divide small conversation nooks filled with couches and soft padded chairs.  A glass door to the rear leads to a garden area."],"exits":[{"to":408,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":397,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":395,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":403,"exit":"go","move":"go glass door"}],"aliases":["Inn of the Crystal Wave","Crystal Wave"]},
  {"id":397,"x":10,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Inn of the Crystal Wave, Hallway","descriptions":["Mats of woven fresh tules besparkled with tiny shells along the outer edges lead down a broad hallway.  An abstract etching of a soaring albatross done in pale pastels hangs on the wall."],"exits":[{"to":396,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":398,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":398,"x":0,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Inn of the Crystal Wave, Hallway","descriptions":["Mats of woven fresh tules besparkled with tiny shells along the outer edges lead down a broad hallway.  An abstract etching of a crab done in pale pastels hangs on the wall."],"exits":[{"to":397,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":399,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":399,"x":-10,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Inn of the Crystal Wave, Hallway","descriptions":["Mats of woven fresh tules besparkled with tiny shells along the outer edges lead down a broad hallway.  An abstract etching of a sea turtle done in pale pastels hangs on the wall."],"exits":[{"to":398,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":400,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairway"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":400,"x":-10,"y":510,"z":0,"title":"Inn of the Crystal Wave, Hallway","descriptions":["Mats of woven fresh tules besparkled with tiny shells along the outer edges lead down a broad hallway.  An abstract etching of an intricate coral fan done in pale pastels hangs on the wall."],"exits":[{"to":401,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":399,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairway"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":401,"x":0,"y":510,"z":0,"title":"Inn of the Crystal Wave, Hallway","descriptions":["Mats of woven fresh tules besparkled with tiny shells along the outer edges lead down a broad hallway.  An abstract etching of a sun-bleached piece of driftwood done in pale pastels hangs on the wall."],"exits":[{"to":402,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":400,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":402,"x":10,"y":510,"z":0,"title":"Inn of the Crystal Wave, Hallway","descriptions":["Mats of woven fresh tules besparkled with tiny shells along the outer edges lead down a broad hallway, ending at a large window looking out on a view of Lake Chawalkas not far away.  The north wall of the hallway is formed by a graceful silverwillow balcony overlooking the entry hall below.  To the other side, an abstract etching of an octopus done in pale pastels hangs on the wall."],"exits":[{"to":401,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":403,"x":-20,"y":490,"z":0,"title":"Inn of the Crystal Wave, Partaking Garden","descriptions":["A broad patio of grey flagstones spans almost the entire rear of the inn, covered by a glazed lattice that allows a view of the night sky.  Glass-topped tables are scattered among young silver plum trees sparkling with tiny lights, a few in private corners, and the scent of blooming flowers from the lawn beyond scents the air.  In the distance, bright streaks on the water reveal where night boaters on Lake Chawalkas pursue their business, or their romances."],"exits":[{"to":405,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":404,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":406,"exit":"go","move":"go dance floor"},{"to":407,"exit":"go","move":"go private corner"},{"to":396,"exit":"go","move":"go glass door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Inn of the Crystal Wave","Crystal Wave"]},
  {"id":404,"x":-20,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Inn of the Crystal Wave, Garden of the Senses","descriptions":["Water trickles down a large stack of randomly fallen boulders, creating tiny and large waterfalls and a constant peaceful background for quiet conversation.  Crystal goblets have been placed nearby, allowing visitors to enjoy the icy cold water.  Fragrant k'dira bushes, blooming roses, and lyrandia vines planted in clumps perfume the air and delight the eyes.  Copperwood benches have been carved and polished into intricate shapes that invite fingers to explore."],"exits":[{"to":403,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":405,"x":-20,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Inn of the Crystal Wave, Serenity Garden","descriptions":["A high, plain wooden fence surrounds the area, cutting off sounds and distractions and leaving only a sense of peace.  At its base, low evergreen shrubs have been trimmed into a uniform hedge.  A crushed white shell pathway encircles the garden, with four benches placed at spaced intervals.  In the center is a large, wind-cut boulder, covered in green lichen on its north side, and surrounded by raked sand."],"exits":[{"to":403,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":406,"x":-30,"y":490,"z":0,"title":"Inn of the Crystal Wave, Dance Floor","descriptions":["The flagstones have been polished and waxed to a mirror finish, providing a smooth surface underfoot for dancing.  The fragrance of the garden flowers and the soft strains of music from somewhere nearby create an intimate atmosphere for a romantic tete-a-tete."],"exits":[{"to":403,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":407,"x":-30,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Inn of the Crystal Wave, Private Corner","descriptions":["Screened from the rest of the garden by planters and small plum trees, this table provides an intimate, private place to enjoy the fine food and drink of the Inn, or just to sit and talk.  The faint background noise of silver chinking on china mingles with the soft sounds of the city at rest for the night."],"exits":[{"to":403,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":408,"x":10,"y":470,"z":0,"title":"Inn of the Crystal Wave, Hallway","descriptions":["Mats of woven fresh tules besparkled with tiny shells along the outer edges lead down a broad hallway.  An abstract etching of a nautilus shell done in pale pastels hangs on the wall."],"exits":[{"to":396,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":411,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":409,"exit":"go","move":"go dark door"},{"to":410,"exit":"go","move":"go pale door"}]},
  {"id":409,"x":10,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Inn of the Crystal Wave, Guestroom","descriptions":["The room is dark and restful, quiet and peaceful.  A soft night-blue wool blanket covers the wide sleeping mat and the wall screens are thick oiled blue paper.  On a low black-lacquered table surrounded by dark velvet seating cushions, an anlas candle burns quietly, shedding a warm golden light over everything."],"exits":[{"to":408,"exit":"go","move":"go blue door"}]},
  {"id":410,"x":20,"y":470,"z":0,"title":"Inn of the Crystal Wave, Guestroom","descriptions":["The wall screens depict crashing waves with flecks of sparkling foam under pale blue sunshine-filled skies.  Silken coverlets and pillows in silvery blue embroidered with milky thread are piled upon the sleeping mat.  Plump cushions provide comfortable seating for intimate conversations."],"exits":[{"to":408,"exit":"go","move":"go blue door"}]},
  {"id":411,"x":0,"y":470,"z":0,"title":"Inn of the Crystal Wave, Hallway","descriptions":["Mats of woven fresh tules besparkled with tiny shells along the outer edges lead down a broad hallway.  An abstract etching of a prowling shark done in pale pastels hangs on the wall."],"exits":[{"to":408,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":414,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":412,"exit":"go","move":"go dark door"},{"to":413,"exit":"go","move":"go pale door"}]},
  {"id":412,"x":0,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Inn of the Crystal Wave, Guestroom","descriptions":["Warm light spills from glass-enclosed lamps scattered about the room, picking up golden highlights in the polished plank floor.  A sleeping mat covered with plump stuffed white comforters is in one corner, next to twin overstuffed low armchairs covered in a patterned fabric of forest greens and browns.  Fresh flowers in a jade vase on a small table perfume the air with a heady floral aroma."],"exits":[{"to":411,"exit":"go","move":"go green door"}]},
  {"id":413,"x":0,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Inn of the Crystal Wave, Guestroom","descriptions":["Mirrored lanterns in the shape of stars twinkle along the walls and sparkle with warm light.  Pale flowered silk coverlets rest upon the sleeping mat, and on the sideboard is a porcelain vase filled with a profusion of amber sweetpeas and baby's breath.  Thick lamb's wool rugs add even more softness to the inviting coziness."],"exits":[{"to":411,"exit":"go","move":"go green door"}]},
  {"id":414,"x":-10,"y":470,"z":0,"title":"Inn of the Crystal Wave, Hallway","descriptions":["Mats of woven fresh tules besparkled with tiny shells along the outer edges lead down a broad hallway.  An abstract etching of a leaping dolphin done in pale pastels hangs on the wall."],"exits":[{"to":411,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":415,"exit":"go","move":"go flame-red door"},{"to":416,"exit":"go","move":"go red door"}]},
  {"id":415,"x":-10,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Inn of the Crystal Wave, Guestroom","descriptions":["A brazier of glowing coals sparkles near the outer wall, filling the room with both warmth and light.  The sleeping mat covers are richly embroidered with swirling flames in golden and copper threads, and a painting of a smoldering mountain hangs above a squat black table and its seating cushions."],"exits":[{"to":414,"exit":"go","move":"go flame-red door"}]},
  {"id":416,"x":-10,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Inn of the Crystal Wave, Guestroom","descriptions":["Bare copperwood floors, polished to a satin sheen, have been covered with woven reed mats.  The ceiling and walls are white, and square beams run overhead from one side of the room to the other.  A line of twisted wooden posts half-separates the sleeping alcove from a sitting area containing several cushions and a low wooden table with an anlas candle on it.  The bed is wide and low to the ground, covered with a quilted unbleached linen blanket."],"exits":[{"to":414,"exit":"go","move":"go red door"}]},
  {"id":417,"x":460,"y":350,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, A Courtyard","descriptions":["The sandy courtyard, usually raked in neat geometric patterns, has a large white boulder in its center instead of the traditional fountain or sculpture.  Slabs of rock, raised a handspan or so above the sand, are smooth and flat -- rather nice spots to rest upon."],"exits":[{"to":90,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":418,"x":460,"y":830,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highland Garden","descriptions":["Woven willow fences the small garden scratched from the hard rocky ground.  Tucked up against the cliffs rising to the south, the garden receives less than ideal light, but still manages to survive and even thrive, with care from all who live here."],"exits":[{"to":267,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":419,"x":400,"y":810,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Cave Mouth","descriptions":["The floor of the cave slopes gently upwards to meet the scooped out walls of the cliff.  A semi-circle of burrow doors reveals this to be a dwelling place of people who apparently feel more safety living within the friable rock than in the path of the pieces that fall from it."],"exits":[{"to":265,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":420,"x":400,"y":770,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands Tower","descriptions":["The only light comes from the arched entrance where once a door must have hung.  The edges of the stones are crumbling into the same shale-like rock of the cliffs, but the floor is smooth clean white stone.  Spiraling up through the ceiling, a narrow stairway has been carved into the curving wall.  A hiss of dry grass, or wind through cracks in stone, softly sounds in the quiet."],"exits":[{"to":268,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":421,"exit":"climb","move":"climb narrow stairway"}]},
  {"id":421,"x":390,"y":780,"z":0,"title":"Highlands Tower, Second Floor","descriptions":["Narrow window slits admit some light, but the round room still seems airless and still.  The floor is curiously bare of the bits of twigs and other nest-building materials that tend to accumulate in abandoned buildings.  A stone staircase leads back down, and a rusted metal staircase continues the climb upward."],"exits":[{"to":420,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stone staircase"},{"to":422,"exit":"climb","move":"climb metal staircase"}]},
  {"id":422,"x":380,"y":790,"z":0,"title":"Highlands Tower, Third Floor Antechamber","descriptions":["Small and windowless, the landing at the top of the stairs is bare of any furniture.  A massive wooden door as thick as a Gor'Tog's hand is wide stands open, the heavy cross bar on its outside now against the wall instead of shot home in the wide iron clasp on the jamb.  Oddly, the bar's location would mean it was used not to keep out intruders, but to contain whoever or whatever was in the room beyond."],"exits":[{"to":423,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"},{"to":421,"exit":"climb","move":"climb metal staircase"}]},
  {"id":423,"x":370,"y":790,"z":0,"title":"Highlands Tower, Chamber","descriptions":["Shreds of ancient luxury still cling to the room, giving hints of the grandeur it must once have contained.  A large four-poster bed stands forlornly, missing its mattress and with only shreds of lace-trimmed pink silk to show where the canopy once hung.  The single window looks out not over the cliffs and what would be a spectacular view of the city, but toward the hillside rising up to the south, creating a curiously closed-in feeling.  An iron hook has been sunk into the stone wall next to the window."],"exits":[{"to":422,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}]},
  {"id":424,"x":100,"y":860,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Meadowlands","descriptions":["The shoulders of the hillside shelter a group of cottages secluded in a grove of crabapple trees and willowy shrubs.  Above, the path skirts a terrace of meadowlands and fields.  A small communal garden fenced by bent willow grows on a flattened area a little farther down the hill."],"exits":[{"to":234,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":425,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":425,"x":100,"y":830,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Garden","descriptions":["A bent willow fence surrounds the garden to keep out trampling sheep.  A pile of stones cleared from the area forms the beginning of a permanent wall along the northern edge.  The soil is rich and deeply plowed, and the flowers and vegetables well-tended in their seasons."],"exits":[{"to":424,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":426,"x":90,"y":530,"z":0,"title":"Rummeltum's Catering","descriptions":["Baskets filled with fresh-baked bread and rolls are piled high beside the counter, and the aroma of roasting meats and pastries fills the air.  The shop bustles with young Halflings carrying food from the stone bakehouse behind the store, or returning empty baskets and platters to be refilled.  A leather-bound menu lies atop the counter, listing the goods offered for sale."],"exits":[{"to":211,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":427,"x":50,"y":890,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Landing Field","descriptions":["The grasses of this wide clearing have been pressed flat under the weight of reiterant traffic.  Various stakes and anchors are installed near the center of the field, while little blue flags are set at even intervals around it to delineate its functional borders."],"exits":[{"to":233,"exit":"go","move":"go beaten footpath"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Landing Field","dirigible","airship","Eternal Etrana","Shard"]},
  {"id":428,"x":250,"y":390,"z":0,"title":"Foundry Commons, Oak Grove","descriptions":["Several towering oaks cast their shade on a narrow avenue of widely spaced shale flagstones wandering down the hill to a cluster of foundry chimneys.  Standing under the trees to one side are three large grindstones -- one worn, another new -- spaced apart to provide solitary workspaces.  A well-trampled path leads through the trees opposite towards three rough wooden structures squatting under the last shade at the edge of the grove.  Across the hillside, a short hike away, is a small gazebo."],"exits":[{"to":127,"exit":"go","move":"go steps"},{"to":429,"exit":"go","move":"go gazebo"},{"to":433,"exit":"go","move":"go path"},{"to":429,"exit":"go","move":"go foundry"}]},
  {"id":429,"x":250,"y":350,"z":0,"title":"A Small Gazebo","descriptions":["The maple flooring has been freshly varnished, reflecting the brilliant white of the intricate railing.  The grassy hill slopes down to a lake which ripples and shimmers, sparkling in the sunlight like an amethyst.  Nearer to hand, a small path leads out of a grove of magnificent oak trees higher up the hill down to three hulking foundry buildings."],"exits":[{"to":428,"exit":"go","move":"go grove"},{"to":430,"exit":"go","move":"go building"}]},
  {"id":430,"x":270,"y":370,"z":0,"title":"Foundry Commons","descriptions":["Obscuring a lake shimmering in the distance are large stone chimneys growing out of three small foundry buildings crafted one of granite, another of brick, and a third of plain grey stone.  Adjacent to the foundries stands a ramshackle wooden shed.  Further up the hill, a grove of huge oak trees provides a welcoming shade from the sun not far from a small gazebo.","A lake shimmers in the distance, obscured by tall sooty stone chimneys attached, one each, to three squat foundry buildings crafted one of granite, another of brick, and a third of plain grey stone.  Bright sparks rise from the stacks and fade like fireflies against the blue-black night sky.  A ramshackle wooden shed leans crookedly at the end of the row.  Further up the hill, not far from a small gazebo, a grove of ancient oaks whispers secrets to the darkness in a soft leafy voice."],"exits":[{"to":429,"exit":"go","move":"go gazebo"},{"to":431,"exit":"go","move":"go stone foundry"},{"to":432,"exit":"go","move":"go shed"},{"to":428,"exit":"go","move":"go grove"},{"to":437,"exit":"go","move":"go granite foundry"},{"to":438,"exit":"go","move":"go brick foundry"}]},
  {"id":431,"x":290,"y":370,"z":0,"title":"Foundry Building","descriptions":["Hot grey stone walls seem to huddle in towards the fire in the small chamber of the foundry.  Hanging over the fire from a thick beam is an enormous crucible occupying a lion's share of the less than ample space.  The rest of the room is crowded with an old, but well-maintained bellows aimed into the glowing coals and a bin of charcoal."],"exits":[{"to":430,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":432,"x":270,"y":390,"z":0,"title":"The Supply Shed","descriptions":["The interior of the shed is remarkably clean and orderly.  Ingots, ores, and tools are stacked, binned, and hung in neat arrays.  A fastidious-looking Dwarf hovers about the materials, constantly rearranging, straightening, and dusting the inventory."],"exits":[{"to":430,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":433,"x":230,"y":390,"z":0,"title":"Edge of the Oak Grove","descriptions":["Three shelters stand at the edge of the grove of towering oaks, providing protection from the elements to those working at the forges within.  The swell of the hill to one side and the thick grove to other allows for view of little but the sky."],"exits":[{"to":434,"exit":"go","move":"go pain shelter"},{"to":435,"exit":"go","move":"go sturdy shelter"},{"to":436,"exit":"go","move":"go weathered shelter"},{"to":428,"exit":"go","move":"go track"}]},
  {"id":434,"x":210,"y":390,"z":0,"title":"The Smithy","descriptions":["As opposed to the bright red exterior, the interior walls are of bare wooden planks.  The heat emanating from a bed of glowing coals in the firepit of a large stone forge bites in the nostrils and lungs overpowering the scent of fresh-cut wood which would otherwise pervade the room.  Between the forge and the water bucket a heavy double-horned anvil sits upon a large slice of tree trunk.  Racks of hammers, tongs, files, and anvil hardies line the walls and the edge of the stone forge."],"exits":[{"to":433,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":435,"x":230,"y":370,"z":0,"title":"The Smithy","descriptions":["A bed of coals glows redly in a stone forge against the back wall, a crude hood and chimney funneling smoke out of the small building.  Sitting atop a thick slice of oaken tree trunk is a well-worn anvil of huge size.  Pegs on the walls hold tongs, hammers, and anvil attachments of assorted sizes.  Near the door sits a heavy mandrel, gathering dust."],"exits":[{"to":433,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":436,"x":210,"y":370,"z":0,"title":"The Smithy","descriptions":["Loosely fitted, weathered planks form the walls of the small structure, providing protection from rain and sun but allowing some wind to seep through to relieve the heat.  A stone forge squats in the rear of the shelter supporting a glowing bed of coals.  Turning from the forge one finds a heavy anvil supported on a pyramid of oak."],"exits":[{"to":433,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":437,"x":290,"y":390,"z":0,"title":"Foundry Building","descriptions":["Thick granite blocks form a wide circular chamber with space for several people to work in the dry heat.  The large single room of the foundry is occupied by an intense fire burning under a huge suspended crucible.  An equally large bellows vents into the coals to produce more intense heat.  A bin of black coal stands near the exit."],"exits":[{"to":430,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":438,"x":290,"y":350,"z":0,"title":"Foundry Building","descriptions":["The brick walls are dry and hot from a fire which heats the cramped quarters like an oven.  An enormous iron lever holds a large crucible suspended from chains at one end.  Poking into a vent in the stone beneath the fire is a large, weighted bellows, its bulk hiding a pile of coal in the shadows by the wall."],"exits":[{"to":430,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":439,"x":250,"y":-21,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Forging Society, Entry and Maker's Mark Sales","descriptions":["High windows are set within the sturdy stone walls just below the vaulted ceilings, each window equiped with louvered vents to help improve the airflow within the working areas.  The walls display some of the many metallic products produced within the workshops, while a few employees bustle about on errands for craftspeople.  The noises of the forges, smithies, and foundries drown out the sounds of the city, making it difficult for anyone to carry on a conversation."],"exits":[{"to":449,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":448,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":447,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":445,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":440,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":8,"exit":"go","move":"go iron-banded door"}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":440,"x":250,"y":-1,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Forging Society, Southern Hallway","descriptions":["High walls meet overhead in an arched roof made from pale woods.  The sounds and smells of metalworking drift down the hallway from the workshop rooms to the south.  Nothing adorns the walls which are fashioned from large polished blocks set within pale mortar."],"exits":[{"to":439,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":443,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":442,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":441,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":444,"exit":"go","move":"go soot-stained doors"}]},
  {"id":441,"x":240,"y":9,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Forging Society, Southern Forge","descriptions":["Arched openings are set into the thick outer stone walls, with the majority of the furnaces set outside the building in an attempt to keep the temperature lower.  Bellows set near the openings allow for air to be forced into the fire as needed.  Bins hold supplies for the working craftspeople."],"exits":[{"to":440,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":442,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":442,"x":250,"y":9,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Forging Society, Southern Foundry","descriptions":["Set into the floor in the center of the room is a brick-lined firepit in which a fire burns white-hot.  All the necessary tools are nearby, set within easy reach of the firepit for the convenience of the craftspeople who use this area.  The room is somewhat hazy from the everpresent ash and soot created from the metallurgical processes."],"exits":[{"to":440,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":443,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":441,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":443,"x":260,"y":9,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Forging Society, Southern Smithy","descriptions":["Set against the outer wall, a small forge allows for the heating of unfinished projects before they are worked on the anvils or other equipment situated around the room.  Large windows set within the thick stone walls help to circulate the air, in a vain attempt to keep the temperature comfortable."],"exits":[{"to":442,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":440,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":444,"x":260,"y":-1,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Forging Society, A Private Forge","descriptions":["Thick walls struggle to contain the blistering heat of the workshop where the fires blaze endlessly night and day.  The flickering flames give a reddish glow to the racks and shelves of tools and equipment, all neatly placed and ready for use.  Workers enter in their protective gear from time to time, checking the equipment and reporting back to a sentry at the entry."],"exits":[{"to":440,"exit":"go","move":"go soot-stained doors"}],"aliases":["Private Forge"]},
  {"id":445,"x":260,"y":-11,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Forging Society, Supplies","descriptions":["Supplies for the craftspeople are sorted into bins and containers that line the walls, each labeled with a neatly-lettered notice detailing the properties of the various materials.  The sounds of the working areas drift into the room, muffled by the thick stone walls."],"exits":[{"to":446,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":439,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":446,"x":270,"y":-11,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Forging Society, Bulk Materials","descriptions":["Offering a respite from the sweltering heat of the forges within, this thatch-covered area provides a service area for deliveries of goods and supplies used by the society's craftsmen.  Crates of tools, metals and more are stacked from floor to ceiling, often at precarious angles that leave the clerks below nervously glancing up from time to time.  Adjacent alleyways of the nearby Rinko neighborhood are within view."],"exits":[{"to":445,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":447,"x":260,"y":-21,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Forging Society, Book Store","descriptions":["Bound instructions and manuals are stacked on shelves, neatly arranged for purchase.  Employees dart in and out in the course of their duties, staying busy while they assist the craftspeople in their crafts."],"exits":[{"to":439,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":448,"x":260,"y":-31,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Forging Society, Tool Store","descriptions":["Bins and shelves display the tools available for purchase, all of them covered with the thin layer of soot and ash that seems to permeate the whole building.  The walls are thick stone and somewhat muffle the din of the workshops enclosed within the large edifice."],"exits":[{"to":439,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":449,"x":250,"y":-31,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Forging Society, Northern Hallway","descriptions":["Narrow clerestory windows allow a little light into the long corridor that stretches towards some of the working areas of the building.  The walls are polished stone, with pale mortar between the blocks creating a contrast with the dark gleaming surfaces.  The acrid smell of molten metal mixes with the underlying smells of soot and fire."],"exits":[{"to":451,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":450,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":439,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":452,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":450,"x":260,"y":-41,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Forging Society, Northern Smithy","descriptions":["Set against the outer wall, a small forge allows for the heating of unfinished projects before they are worked on the anvils or other equipment situated around the room.  Large windows set within the thick stone walls help to circulate the air, in a vain attempt to keep the temperature comfortable."],"exits":[{"to":449,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":451,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":451,"x":250,"y":-41,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Forging Society, Northern Foundry","descriptions":["Set into the floor in the center of the room is a brick-lined firepit in which a fire burns white-hot.  All the necessary tools are nearby, set within easy reach of the firepit for the convenience of the craftspeople who use this area.  The room is somewhat hazy from the everpresent ash and soot created from the metallurgical processes."],"exits":[{"to":450,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":449,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":452,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":452,"x":240,"y":-41,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Forging Society, Northern Forge","descriptions":["Arched openings are set into the thick outer stone walls, with the majority of the furnaces set outside the building in an attempt to keep the temperature lower.  Bellows set near the openings allow for air to be forced into the fire as needed.  Bins hold supplies for the working craftspeople."],"exits":[{"to":451,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":449,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":453,"x":232,"y":151,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Enchanting Society, Supply Store","descriptions":["Plain plastered walls hold up the wooden shelves and racks that hold the supplies on offer to craftspeople.  A young S'Kra Mur attendant bustles about, moving between the surfaces as they attend to customers."],"exits":[{"to":454,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":456,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":455,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":51,"exit":"go","move":"go plain door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":454,"x":242,"y":151,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Enchanting Society, Tool Outlet","descriptions":["A multitude of wooden crates and boxes fill the racks that hold all manner of supplies available to those visiting the society.  Clerks bustle back and forth filling orders and restocking items."],"exits":[{"to":453,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":455,"x":222,"y":151,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Enchanting Society, Bookstore","descriptions":["Tall wooden bookshelves overflowing with a variety of old and new tomes and scrolls surround the room.  A short assistant pores over several of the selections, while a cloaked S'Kra Mur attendant tends to the needs of visiting artisans."],"exits":[{"to":453,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":456,"x":232,"y":171,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Enchanting Society, Corridor","descriptions":["Plastered walls line this utilitarian space that allows access to the workrooms beyond.  Brass chandeliers dangle overhead from the roughly cut wooden beams."],"exits":[{"to":453,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":457,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":458,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":459,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":460,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":461,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go shadowed alcove"}]},
  {"id":457,"x":242,"y":171,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Enchanting Society, Green Workroom","descriptions":["The deep green of the walls is offset by the pale hues of the baseboards, while overhead is a coffered ceiling painted a pure white.  Blown glass globes overhead enclose gaethzen spheres providing illumination for enchanters to work their craft."],"exits":[{"to":456,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":458,"x":242,"y":181,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Enchanting Society, Yellow Workroom","descriptions":["The rich yellow of the walls is offset by the pale hues of the baseboards, while overhead is a coffered ceiling painted a pure white.  Blown glass globes overhead enclose gaethzen spheres providing illumination for enchanters to work their craft."],"exits":[{"to":456,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":459,"x":232,"y":181,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Enchanting Society, Society Master's Office","descriptions":["A solitary mat lies on the floor in front of a small table piled with papers and writing instruments.  The plain plastered walls and polished wood of the floor have an elegant simplicity that keeps distractions to a minimum."],"exits":[{"to":456,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":460,"x":222,"y":181,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Enchanting Society, Red Workroom","descriptions":["The deep red of the walls is offset by the pale hues of the baseboards, while overhead is a coffered ceiling painted a pure white.  Blown glass globes overhead enclose gaethzen spheres providing illumination for enchanters to work their craft."],"exits":[{"to":456,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}]},
  {"id":461,"x":222,"y":171,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Enchanting Society, Blue Workroom","descriptions":["The deep blue of the walls is offset by the pale hues of the baseboards, while overhead is a coffered ceiling painted a pure white.  Blown glass globes overhead enclose gaethzen spheres providing illumination for enchanters to work their craft."],"exits":[{"to":456,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":462,"x":242,"y":161,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Enchanting Society, A Private Enchanting Room","descriptions":["Pieced together by a seemingly blind worker, the walls are covered with scraps of rugs, blankets, and carpets in a kaleidoscope of colors.  A burly, light pink feldspar table is stashed in a corner of the room, providing plenty of room to work."],"exits":[{"to":456,"exit":"go","move":"go shadowed alcove"}]}
 ],
